/pull/4909\">module-federation/core#4909</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bug Fixes 🐞</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>fix(runtime-core): avoid executing ESM remote chunks before init by\n<a href=\"https://github.com/dmchoi77\"><code>@​dmchoi77</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/module-federation/core/pull/4886\">module-federation/core#4886</a></li>\n<li>fix(metro): resolve Windows hoisted split bundles by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/jbroma\"><code>@​jbroma</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/module-federation/core/pull/4912\">module-federation/core#4912</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Other Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>ci(e2e): gate affected workflows before runner setup by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ScriptedAlchemy\"><code>@​ScriptedAlchemy</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/module-federation/core/pull/4864\">module-federation/core#4864</a></li>\n<li>chore(deps): bump axios from 1.16.1 to 1.18.0 by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a>[bot]\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/module-federation/core/pull/4915\">module-federation/core#4915</a></li>\n<li>chore(deps): bump axios from 1.16.1 to 1.18.0 in\n/packages/typescript by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a>[bot]\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/module-federation/core/pull/4914\">module-federation/core#4914</a></li>\n<li>chore(deps): bump adm-zip from 0.5.10 to 0.6.0 in\n/packages/dts-plugin by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a>[bot]\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/module-federation/core/pull/4910\">module-federation/core#4910</a></li>\n<li>chore(deps): bump adm-zip from 0.5.10 to 0.6.0 by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a>[bot]\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/module-federation/core/pull/4911\">module-federation/core#4911</a></li>\n<li>chore(deps-dev): bump vitest from 1.2.2 to 3.2.6 by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com