SE_URL` set\n- [x] `make canvas-remote-build` / `packages/canvas-remote` production\nbuild\n- [x] frontend vitest + tsc/eslint on touched files\n- [x] `go test ./pkg/version ./pkg/nodetype`\n- [x] Optional: `make run-sidecar-external-db` against a local Postgres\nwith `init-host-sidecar.sql`\n- [x] Optional: host SPA loads `http://localhost:3002/remoteEntry.js`\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"ffcdc83ed3bf94031ee2a873408d1f26bf48b15b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madmmas/temflowral/git/trees/ffcdc83ed3bf94031ee2a873408d1f26bf48b15b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madmmas/temflowral/git/commits/a39ca0b928b2ee47851601bb7d69a89c658aab53","verification":{"payload":"tree ffcdc83ed3bf94031ee2a873408d1f26bf48b15b\nparent 10b2186ba4d4f2aa1e2899846c997711e7f62f6b\nauthor Moinuddin M Masud <moinuddinmasud@gmail.com> 1787209786 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787209786 -0700\n\nfeat: sidecar compose and Module Federation workflow builder (#129)\n\n## Summary\n- Sidecar stack (`docker-compose.sidecar.yml`) for BYO Postgres + docs\n(`docs/sidecar.md`, host init SQL).\n- Embeddable `WorkflowBuilder` props (`apiBaseUrl`, auth, callbacks)\nwith `ApiClientProvider`.\n- Module Federation remote in `packages/canvas-remote` + embedding guide\nand ADR-002 (amends ADR-001).\n- CI builds `remoteEntry.js`; `backend/pkg/version` for Go consumers.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `docker compose -f docker-compose.sidecar.yml config` with\n`DATABASE_URL` set\n- [x] `make canvas-remote-build` / `packages/canvas-remote` production\nbuild\n- [x] frontend vitest + tsc/eslint on touched files\n- [x] `go test ./pkg/version ./pkg/nodetype`\n- [x] Optional: `make run-sidecar-external-db` against a local Postgres\nwith `init-host-sidecar.sql`\n- [x] Optional: host SPA loads `http://localhost:3002/remoteEntry.js`\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reas