 from being color-only;\n`data-execution-status` / testids for e2e.\n- Happy-path mock returns structured `result.nodes` matching the placed\nStart id; scaffold asserts idle before any run.\n\n## Interim vs live progress\nThis is an **interim** UX on existing contract fields — no OpenAPI\nchange. Full live **pending/running** (and per-node **failed**) needs a\nqueryable mid-run progress field on `GET /runs/{id}` (or similar). Until\nthen, completed nodes light up after the run finishes (when `result` is\npresent), and wait nodes show Waiting while `currentWait` is set.\n\nFixes #113\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `vitest` `node-execution-status`\n- [x] `tsc` / eslint on touched files\n- [x] Playwright happy-path (Done badge) + scaffold idle chrome\n- [x] Manual: run a wait graph and confirm Waiting badge on the wait\nnode while signal panel is active\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"d8c1682bcd4102a0bf1d507ea77176e1bca25d1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madmmas/temflowral/git/trees/d8c1682bcd4102a0bf1d507ea77176e1bca25d1f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madmmas/temflowral/git/commits/6c1ca9e884ccf98111f1b37213fef8f6b4d173bd","verification":{"payload":"tree d8c1682bcd4102a0bf1d507ea77176e1bca25d1f\nparent f9c790fde861f12e70badaeece43f57f475d56fb\nauthor Moinuddin M Masud <moinuddinmasud@gmail.com> 1786272623 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786272623 -0700\n\nfeat(canvas): per-node run status on the canvas (#113) (#127)\n\n## Summary\n- Decorate canvas nodes with execution chrome driven by the active\n`Run`: **Done** from `result.nodes[].nodeId`, **Waiting** (+ pulse) from\n`currentWait.nodeId`, otherwise idle.\n- Labels on badges keep status from being color-only;\n`data-execution-status` / testids for e2e.\n- Happy-path mock returns structured `result.nodes` matching the placed\nStart id; scaffold asserts idle before any run.\n\n## Interim vs live progress\nThis is an **interim** UX on existing contract fields — no OpenAPI\nchange. Full live **pending/running** (and per-node **failed**) needs a\nqueryable mid-run progress field on `GET /runs/{id}` (or similar). Until\nthen, completed nodes light up after the run finishes (when `result` is\npresent), and wait nodes show Waiting while `currentWait` is set.\n\nFixes #113\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `vitest` `node-execution-status`\n- [x] `tsc` / eslint on touched files\n- [x] Playwright happy-path (Done badge) + scaffold idle chrome\n- [x] Manual: run a wait graph and confirm Waiting badge on the wait\nnode while signal panel is active\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqeFtvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAevIQAJQgaWj/AxXdamSxP9v+odk8\np1E8CRJR0kqAWXVFPnBaA6v14PBGd3mMGQ4xloJLS1XwYcJ7EZb2Q7z/NCXNinGQ\nabCZu7U2OjZIBz0l88b9ifZbYvUKMS2HK6JTr8N1LWyAA4MMou8aRHfKzt7WTAP2\nE+TxfBTySeulJBTU5Z+vDrgXR4L7jvQWYKxwk+n6eVVFpukcXy9xu6tJSTs139Xe\nUHfJQtgXpetWsBGkoNDRB3eqWSGzM4jlmVVEhTAXjLG/x2x2eS8B2Hmz5psSkQfS\nepFAKoq5e7imfzHVH7nxf7oKpBsNy2OmsEpbPSRnIzqB0YOdtg5iOrJvCVPsCOFz\ncqNoHoup9RQyBzZVcRZaGnqvrmE3XyqE5Nq1q0L0++rj4pbqCrYTGRvDi+AG7wSi\nFH5OloH4qA4hclTJYzc5vPuxuQpOvbctheik5R3IOMZjC8rkYOobEscLQtFO32Hu\nSla/TiHaE/u1OMyOsx4sHJACV3znwLOiVIHjdhTepPFitpBcPeBTui4R2z+oHUoG\nplycifxkVg623RY3msNrUkqcKRCv2PZ4eCzfHTvCu0DSE7CdmnQz9S2RNMhmMTsi\nlUoIWyYsALk8KLwRR4DB0sbo5njjYH8OHK/V8kMYbfiCvlsU/l+HHVoBgFlX8/io\nUVg3XSlZff4yUJAvI6lr\n=I0c1\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-10T10:34:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","htm