ate\nresolution)\n- [x] `make test-contract`\n- [x] Optional manual: start → HTTP with `url: https://allowlisted/{{\nnodes.start-1.output.id }}`; confirm wait+`{{` → 400; confirm rendered\nprivate host still SSRF-blocked\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"ce4d0c27e29974d243a632139c0366849fa0a64b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madmmas/temflowral/git/trees/ce4d0c27e29974d243a632139c0366849fa0a64b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madmmas/temflowral/git/commits/936dc399f1cd0b14aca02c71a0e67eac838d7362","verification":{"payload":"tree ce4d0c27e29974d243a632139c0366849fa0a64b\nparent e1540a5027410898fb638d32700c3c0776f2a4df\nauthor Moinuddin M Masud <moinuddinmasud@gmail.com> 1784637395 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784637395 -0700\n\nfeat(executor): config templating (#63) (#79)\n\n## Summary\n- Minimal `{{ nodes.<nodeId>.output.<path> }}` templating resolved in\nGraphWorkflow from active predecessor outputs (whole-string typed\nvalues; mid-string scalars only).\n- HTTP plan-time softens absolute-URI checks when templates are present;\nthe activity still fully revalidates rendered URL/headers/body. Wait\nconfigs reject templates; `childWorkflow.graph` is left unresolved for\nthe child run.\n- OpenAPI drops `format: uri` on HTTP url so templated strings are\nallowed; SECURITY/docs/CHANGELOG/ISSUES updated.\n\nCloses https://github.com/madmmas/temflowral/issues/63\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `make generate`\n- [x] Redocly lint on `api/openapi.yaml`\n- [x] `make lint`\n- [x] `make test` (incl. template unit + GraphWorkflow template\nresolution)\n- [x] `make test-contract`\n- [x] Optional manual: start → HTTP with `url: https://allowlisted/{{\nnodes.start-1.output.id }}`; confirm wait+`{{` → 400; confirm rendered\nprivate host still SSRF-blocked\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqX2fTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/XAQAK8AFEtPg292W7WIXMfDvzUN