61) (#77)\n\n## Summary\n- Adds optional `Node.taskQueue` so activity-backed nodes can route to a\nTemporal task queue other than the workflow default.\n- Applied via `ActivityOptions.TaskQueue` alongside existing\n`activityOptions`; CreateGraph/planner reject `taskQueue` on\nworkflow-native types.\n- Docs and tests cover accept/reject paths and assert the scheduled\nactivity queue.\n\nCloses #61\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `make generate`\n- [x] Redocly lint on `api/openapi.yaml`\n- [x] `make test` / `make lint` / `make test-contract`\n- [x] Optional live: run a specialized worker on queue `worker.gpu`,\nstart a graph with a noop/http node `taskQueue: worker.gpu`, confirm the\nactivity appears on that queue in Temporal UI\n- [x] Confirm CreateGraph returns 400 when `taskQueue` is set on\ndelay/wait\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"20743bf9b71a18ad26f2c0445fa92adc553778a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madmmas/temflowral/git/trees/20743bf9b71a18ad26f2c0445fa92adc553778a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madmmas/temflowral/git/commits/522e4bb480e3747db0c0f0a2128eeef47becdded","verification":{"payload":"tree 20743bf9b71a18ad26f2c0445fa92adc553778a9\nparent 6474571993e07d451c10ad8f91593fa8ceb23d1d\nauthor Moinuddin M Masud <moinuddinmasud@gmail.com> 1784636265 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784636265 -0700\n\nfeat(executor): per-node task-queue routing (#61) (#77)\n\n## Summary\n- Adds optional `Node.taskQueue` so activity-backed nodes can route to a\nTemporal task queue other than the workflow default.\n- Applied via `ActivityOptions.TaskQueue` alongside existing\n`activityOptions`; CreateGraph/planner reject `taskQueue` on\nworkflow-native types.\n- Docs and tests cover accept/reject paths and assert the scheduled\nactivity queue.\n\nCloses #61\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `make generate`\n- [x] Redocly lint on `api/openapi.yaml`\n- [x] `make test` / `make lint` / `make test-contract`\n- [x] Optional live: run a specia