ore wording in OpenAPI tags/operation\ndescriptions; updates docs/CHANGELOG/ISSUES.\n\nCloses #56\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `make generate`\n- [x] Redocly lint `api/openapi.yaml`\n- [x] `make test` / `make lint` / `make test-contract`\n- [x] Postgres round-trip: `DATABASE_URL=... go test ./internal/store\n-run TestPostgres`\n- [x] Optional live: `docker compose up`, create a graph + run, restart\nbackend container, confirm `GET /runs/{id}` still finds the run\n\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"95b907ef668889e1101ddbf46078bfb74f06b5ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madmmas/temflowral/git/trees/95b907ef668889e1101ddbf46078bfb74f06b5ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madmmas/temflowral/git/commits/98de95e69472e71369cdda2c8ba65d8899a023b4","verification":{"payload":"tree 95b907ef668889e1101ddbf46078bfb74f06b5ed\nparent 6f5353e3e0f2ced40fde3f9862f4bc8125bb70ab\nauthor Moinuddin M Masud <moinuddinmasud@gmail.com> 1784519577 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784519577 -0700\n\nfeat(store): durable Postgres graph/run store (#56) (#71)\n\n## Summary\n- Adds a pluggable `backend/internal/store.Store` with Postgres\npersistence via required `DATABASE_URL` (fails loudly if unset;\nin-memory only with explicit `STORE_ALLOW_MEMORY=1`).\n- Compose creates a dedicated `temflowral` database, publishes Postgres\n`:5432`, and wires the backend DSN; schema is embedded and applied on\nopen.\n- Clarifies durable-store wording in OpenAPI tags/operation\ndescriptions; updates docs/CHANGELOG/ISSUES.\n\nCloses #56\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `make generate`\n- [x] Redocly lint `api/openapi.yaml`\n- [x] `make test` / `make lint` / `make test-contract`\n- [x] Postgres round-trip: `DATABASE_URL=... go test ./internal/store\n-run TestPostgres`\n- [x] Optional live: `docker compose up`, create a graph + run, restart\nbackend container, confirm `GET /runs/{id}` still finds the run\n\n\nMade with [Cursor](ht