, and regenerate\nGo/TypeScript models\n- add HTTP config validation during graph creation and execution\nplanning, register the HTTP Temporal activity, and return bounded 2xx\nresponse results\n- enforce a deny-by-default `HTTP_ALLOWED_HOSTS` policy with exact\nhosts, dial-time DNS/IP validation, private/loopback/link-local\nblocking, redirect revalidation, no environment proxies, request\ntimeouts, payload/header limits, and sensitive URL error redaction\n- disable Temporal activity retries to avoid replaying POST/PATCH side\neffects; intentionally leave template interpolation unsupported\n- document operator configuration/security boundaries and add planner,\nworkflow, API, activity, SSRF, payload-limit, and error-redaction tests\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] Redocly OpenAPI lint\n- [x] generated Go/TypeScript clients refreshed\n- [x] pre-commit golangci-lint v2.12.2 (0 issues)\n- [x] `go vet ./...`\n- [x] `go test -race ./...`\n- [x] frontend ESLint and Vitest (15/15)\n- [x] frontend production build\n- [x] contract conformance (6/6)\n- [x] Optional manual live check: start Temporal, run\n`HTTP_ALLOWED_HOSTS=httpbin.org make run-backend`, create a start → HTTP\ngraph targeting `https://httpbin.org/get`, then poll the run to\ncompletion\n\n## Security notes\n- outbound HTTP is denied unless the hostname is explicitly configured\n- localhost, private/link-local destinations, unsafe redirects,\ntransport-controlled headers, oversized payloads, environment proxies,\nand automatic activity retries are blocked\n- no URL/header/body templating is performed\n\nCloses #21\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"1931550150236f7d88767809de8274d8ed916bce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madmmas/temflowral/git/trees/1931550150236f7d88767809de8274d8ed916bce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madmmas/temflowral/git/commits/9259b2f35ed3c2fca214472470725ee95ec66539","verification":{"payload":"tree 1931550150236