hub.com/users/madmmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madmmas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/madmmas","id":27513946,"login":"madmmas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NTEzOTQ2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madmmas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madmmas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madmmas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madmmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madmmas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madmmas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madmmas/temflowral/commits/6a88c8ef2eca78b6409035aba8f80b1d1a483871/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-19T11:55:33Z","email":"moinuddinmasud@gmail.com","name":"Moinuddin M Masud"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-19T11:55:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(frontend): save and run canvas graphs (#17) (#44)\n\nCloses #17\n\n## Summary\n- Serialize React Flow nodes/edges to the generated `CreateGraphRequest`\ntype and save through `POST /graphs`.\n- Add graph-name, Save, and Run controls; Run saves current state before\ncalling `POST /graphs/{id}/run`.\n- Poll `GET /runs/{id}` every 1.5 seconds until completed, failed, or\ncancelled, with status/error feedback.\n- Add tests for serialization, terminal run states, and typed API error\nextraction.\n\n## Notes\n- Branch linked to issue #17 via `gh issue develop`.\n- Saving current state before every run prevents stale graph execution\nafter canvas edits.\n- Poll cleanup cancels timers and ignores stale responses.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `cd frontend && npm test -- --run` (15 tests)\n- [x] `cd frontend && npm run lint`\n- [x] `cd frontend && npm run build`\n- [x] Browser render smoke against Prism (palette and controls rendered)\n- [x] Prism API integration: create `201`, run `202`, poll `200`\n(`running`)\n- [x] Manual UX: with Prism or the real stack running, add/connect\nnodes, edit the graph name, click Save, then Run, and confirm graph ID\nplus run status appear\n- [x] Real backend/Temporal (optional): use a Start → No-op graph and\nconfirm status reaches `completed`\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"6d1abd194e841d0580b497726e53242080f64788","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madmmas/temflowral/git/trees/6d1abd194e841d0580b497726e53242080f64788"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madmmas/temflowral/git/commits/6a88c8ef2eca78b6409035aba8f80b1d1a483871","verification":{"payload":"tree 6d1abd194e841d0580b497726e53242080f64788\nparent b8f5af1817a440643194ce3e6480ff48b1b37592\nauthor Moinuddin M Masud <moinuddinmasud@gmail.com> 1784462133 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784462133 -0700\n\nfeat(frontend): save and run canvas graphs (#17) (#44)\n\nCloses #17\n\n## Summary\n- Serialize React Flow nodes/edges to the generated `CreateGraphRequest`\ntype and save through `POST /graphs`.\n- Add graph-name, Save, and Run controls; Run saves current state before\ncalling `POST /graphs/{id}/run`.\n- Poll `GET /runs/{id}` every 1.5 seconds until completed, failed, or\ncancelled, with status/error feedback.\n- Add tests for serialization, terminal run states, and typed API error\nextraction.\n\n## Notes\n- Branch linked to issue #17 via `gh issue develop`.\n- Saving current state before every run prevents stale graph execution\nafter canvas edits.\n- Poll cleanup cancels timers and ignores stale responses.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `cd frontend && npm test -- --run` (15 tests)\n- [x] `cd frontend && npm run lint`\n- [x] `cd frontend && npm run build`\n- [x] Browser render smoke against Prism (palette and controls rendered)\n- [x] Prism API integration: create `201`, run `202`, poll `200`\n(`running`)\n- [x] Manual UX: with Prism or the real stack running, add/connect\nnodes, edit the graph name, click Save, then Run, and confirm graph ID\nplus run status appear\n- [x] Real backend/Temporal (optional): use a Start → No-op graph and\nconfirm status reaches `completed`\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqXLs1CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAktEQAGbpfZw49vfinHl6zMOZ6rMj\n4xO18Lqxmnfp3gfFhaOf2G1zQc14cpRoZ6UxPeV0g20oM7bQ4gx6amcsfE3YCfDh\nz604mnLMddmnA5ZLFyN5G4lpxZJazcx4yswbCxpQdZ+pzM7V481mANTsBRggSS63\nhfxMdfeBy2F8aGXI6OMZfSErTOHFGU2u+WNmkliC2NXzsIE4sNd1pmdhLqVhYnIZ\nDUwMIOZ2bpRsAKZfqIExS1S0xzVbDwXH1U14a6RUcO7aQGpGp0b7NGKNfogUYP46\nBfkH2lVxzDG6oW2sIAh9e7WzeJGFyPZ2C2X5tTlK5rnFx+6RvnXakexxRCZkf88A\nF1fnfHVp8j4w/jWGdpzUjzEpKbsIeb0fDIFgybX7G57NAh6ba17Ult2bWVNkTVDR\ngznUAulhksBSh0g+4qB5/GgyevuCySFsd0MXBcKDU5qVXyvZNGcREtPGIUlNTi8V\nPoUwQ9Q1A6RzA9tOzLyEezcnkF/N+d2FG0QpMe+MDuhldmXsAGKglYCXzAp2UXvi\nplBN6D7Byv3WbShDXODiB7CIk2SqriE0JO9tzBe7MBOQCm6bzFMAVWTW+X60HK7u\n0y3oFkZj/VSyanVIPHLV2GcUuLiqiCtEG1U1zP7EOAD2+1HeBntm9tAPnSkbR/Om\naHWZP9FE7lo3OY2h2YUZ\n=TGlJ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-19T11:55:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starr