ravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/madmmas","id":27513946,"login":"madmmas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NTEzOTQ2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madmmas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madmmas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madmmas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madmmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madmmas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madmmas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madmmas/temflowral/commits/bcc84faea0961ad077ae4be7be2080c8f1c90221/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-19T10:41:22Z","email":"moinuddinmasud@gmail.com","name":"Moinuddin M Masud"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-19T10:41:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(frontend): bootstrap Next.js app scaffold (#13) (#36)\n\n## Summary\n- Scaffold `frontend/` with Next.js 15 (App Router), TypeScript,\nTailwind, ESLint, and a `src/` layout (#13).\n- Add Vitest plus a smoke test for the API base-URL helper (defaults to\nthe Prism mock on `:4010`, overridable via `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL`).\n- Replace the create-next-app boilerplate with a minimal temflowral\nshell; document local scripts in `frontend/README.md` and\n`frontend/.env.example`.\n- Allowlist `.env.example` in the pre-commit secret-filename check so\nthe env template can be committed.\n\n## Notes\n- Pinned to Next.js `15.5.9` (patched for CVE-2025-66478). Next 16\nbreaks the FlatCompat ESLint config shipped by create-next-app —\ndeferred.\n- Vitest pinned to `3.2.6+` for the UI-server advisory fix.\n- Lands in parallel with backend codegen (#10); next up is #14 (typed\nAPI client).\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `npm test` (Vitest) passes\n- [x] `npm run lint` clean\n- [x] `npm run build` succeeds\n- [x] Reviewer: `npm run dev` and confirm the home page renders at\n