flowral/commits/4900ba41552f19d31d2e4958b1b3de3bc08b8848/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T09:03:45Z","email":"moinuddinmasud@gmail.com","name":"Moinuddin M Masud"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T09:03:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(api): add OpenAPI v0.1 contract (#6) (#32)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Adds `api/openapi.yaml` v0.1 — the contract-first API spec that\nunblocks backend codegen (#10), frontend typed client (#14), and Prism\nmock server (#8).\n- Defines five endpoints: `POST /graphs`, `GET /graphs/{id}`, `POST\n/graphs/{id}/run`, `GET /runs/{id}`, `GET /node-types`.\n- Defines core schemas: `Graph`, `Node`, `Edge`, `NodeType`, `Run`,\n`RunStatus`, plus shared `Error` and request DTOs.\n- OpenAPI 3.1, no auth in v0.1 (`security: []` declared explicitly).\nIncludes realistic examples for Prism mock responses.\n\nCloses #6\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] YAML parses cleanly (`python3 -c \"import yaml;\nyaml.safe_load(...)\"`)\n- [x] Redocly CLI lint passes (`npx @redocly/cli lint api/openapi.yaml`)\n— 1 benign localhost warning only\n- [x] Prism mock smoke test: `npx @stoplight/prism-cli mock\napi/openapi.yaml`, then `GET /node-types` and `POST /graphs` return\nschema-conformant JSON\n- [x] CI jobs skip gracefully (no backend/frontend code changed)\n\n## Manual testing\n\n**Not required to merge this PR.** Validation was automated (Redocly\nlint + Prism smoke test). Optional reviewer spot-check:\n\n1. Open `api/openapi.yaml` in [Swagger\nEditor](https://editor.swagger.io/) or Redocly preview\n2. Run `npx @stoplight/prism-cli mock api/openapi.yaml` and browse\n`http://127.0.0.1:4010/node-types`\n\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"dc47ce521976d177b14518a3bc4863f996f8ce1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madmmas/temflowral/git/trees/dc47ce521976d177b14518a3bc4863f996f8ce1b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madmmas/temflowral/