n\n- [x] On `main`, `git commit` is blocked by pre-commit\n- [x] `git push origin HEAD:main` from a feature branch is blocked by\npre-push\n- [x] Pushing a feature branch to origin succeeds\n- [x] Merging via PR still works on GitHub\n\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"32cc7c22596503c19b2c2bd00b47be32bcf9ec2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madmmas/temflowral/git/trees/32cc7c22596503c19b2c2bd00b47be32bcf9ec2a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madmmas/temflowral/git/commits/948ec9113347a0264327a1ad3a447569e105218e","verification":{"payload":"tree 32cc7c22596503c19b2c2bd00b47be32bcf9ec2a\nparent b5c6fb77ffd31830dfd5c9ef49d4cce14049bed8\nauthor Moinuddin M Masud <moinuddinmasud@gmail.com> 1784191025 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784191025 -0700\n\nchore: block direct commits and pushes to main (#31)\n\n## Summary\n- Extend `.githooks/pre-commit` to refuse commits on `main` (and\n`master`).\n- Add `.githooks/pre-push` to block direct pushes to protected branches.\n- Document the feature-branch workflow in `CONTRIBUTING.md`.\n- GitHub ruleset **Main-branch** updated with the `update` rule so\ndirect pushes to `main` are rejected server-side too (PR + status checks\n+ linear history already enforced).\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] On `main`, `git commit` is blocked by pre-commit\n- [x] `git push origin HEAD:main` from a feature branch is blocked by\npre-push\n- [x] Pushing a feature branch to origin succeeds\n- [x] Merging via PR still works on GitHub\n\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWJgxCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAhBQQAFjYnohzI7IlBGZxU30oL65W\nj2jRjJSCDEoPfYvO343H22xiTCf/RxJjqK9ZPww7DkqDOmqatrattQn1lxxZIa4P\n2H1JeQfu9675JqswEw9WSCflk2IO+3AQLl6Tf7ssTRK5J9UII0W59yjwYy0fr5wJ\nuBtf+lbn+XMVci9fi1G1uPuMesZHnPiV/XO+wqfL8kG3Lmq91SH6A/nkzdhycCtK\ntLVCLe4RCBN4R0