age":"Add contextual help bubbles and UI\n\nIntroduce a lightweight contextual help system: add src/help.ts (helpEnabled, activeHelp, HELP texts and a Svelte action help that shows a bubble after 500ms hover). Wire the action into UI elements across components (AudioControls, CryptoChart, OutputScope) using use:help={HELP.key} and add help keys to model params. Update the main page (+page.svelte) to provide a toggle for showing help bubbles, render the positioned help bubble (with fade transition), and include CSS for the toggle and bubble. Help texts are placeholders and can be replaced with real explanations.","tree":{"sha":"72a12afde83be1899b77de552b25bf9bec26243a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BitResonant/SoniChain/git/trees/72a12afde83be1899b77de552b25bf9bec26243a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BitResonant/SoniChain/git/commits/d752d5341ab94a8589726aba9c84c736aa478885","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274306202?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BitResonant","id":274306202,"login":"BitResonant","node_id":"U_kgDOEFmUmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BitResonant/SoniChain/commit/d752d5341ab94a8589726aba9c84c736aa478885","node_id":"C_kwDOS9YqDdoAKGQ3NTJkNTM0MWFiOTRhODU4OTcyNmFiYTljODRjNzM2YWE0Nzg4ODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BitResonant/SoniChain/commit/a964d6d5729c704592a5e874e43d22835de2ef6d","sha":"a964d6d5729c704592a5e874e43d22835de2ef6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BitResonant/SoniChain/commits/a964d6d5729c704592a5e874e43d22835de2ef6d"}],"sha":"d752d5341ab94a8589726aba9c84c736aa478885","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BitResonant/SoniChain/commits/d752d5341ab94a8589726aba9c84c736aa478885"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274306202?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BitResonant","id":274306202,"login":"BitResonant","node_id":"U_kgDOEFmUmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BitResonant/SoniChain/commits/a964d6d5729c704592a5e874e43d22835de2ef6d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T20:35:09Z","email":"matteo.caruso.linardon@gmail.com","name":"BitResonant"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T20:35:09Z","email":"matteo.caruso.linardon@gmail.com","name":"BitResonant"},"message":"Improve OutputScope: adaptive norm, flow ramp\n\nAdd adaptive normalization and flow ramping to the audio scope and wire new raw market signals through the page. OutputScope: implement adaptive threshold capture/decay for volatility and density (capture during calibration, linear decay over 60s), compute vol/density % outputs, add linear flow ramp toward makerTarget to produce a smooth flowImbalance, clamp and apply UI-only gains for scope/goniometer rendering, and adjust goniometer scaling. Also invert flow fill direction and swap flow labels. AudioControls: minor UI text tweaks (e.g. \"Audio engine\", \"Volume\", \"scale selector\", \"sensitivity\"), allow dropdown menus to open upward with new .dd-menu.up styles. Routes (+page.svelte): forward new props (makerTarget, densityRaw, volatilityRaw, tickSeq, calibrating) to OutputScope, bump UI meter gain, rename app title/subtitle and adjust calibration copy. These changes separate raw market measurement (collected in +page.svelte) from UI normalization/visualization logic (handled in OutputScope) and improve visual stability and calibration behavior.","tree":{"sha":"74845c44891352170dbb834ae528a001023ca703","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BitResonant/SoniChain/git/trees/74845c44891352170dbb834ae528a001023ca703"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BitResonant/SoniChain/git/commits/a964d6d5729c704592a5e874e43d22835de2ef6d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274306202?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BitResonant","id":274306202,"login":"BitResonant","node_id":"U_kgDOEFmUmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BitResonant/SoniChain/commit/a964d6d5729c704592a5e874e43d22835de2ef6d","node_id":"C_kwDOS9YqDdoAKGE5NjRkNmQ1NzI5YzcwNDU5MmE1ZTg3NGU0M2QyMjgzNWRlMmVmNmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BitResonant/SoniChain/commit/83c31687bc600c9f9e97e731cb54db4a4c31692e","sha":"83c31687bc600c9f9e97e731cb54db4a4c31692e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BitResonant/SoniChain/commits/83c31687bc600c9f9e97e731cb54db4a4c31692e"}],"sha":"a964d6d5729c704592a5e874e43d22835de2ef6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BitResonant/SoniChain/commits/a964d6d5729c704592a5e874e43d22835de2ef6d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274306202?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BitResonant","id":274306202,"login":"BitResonant","node_id":"U_kgDOEFmUmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BitResonant/SoniChain/commits/83c31687bc600c9f9e97e731cb54db4a4c31692e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T19:36:12Z","email":"matteo.caruso.linardon@gmail.com","name":"BitResonant"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T19:36:12Z","email":"matteo.caruso.linardon@gmail.com","name":"BitResonant"},"message":"AudioControls redesign, chart theming, add scope\n\nRevamp UI and rendering for audio/visual components: rework AudioControls with new props and layout (custom fader, dropdowns, segmented sensitivity, meters, play/recalibrate, help hooks removed), update CryptoChart to use theme tokens and simplified canvas rendering, and add a new OutputScope component (oscilloscope + goniometer) for audio analysis. Also switch site fonts in app.html and add a themes.ts to centralize theme values; update +page.svelte to integrate these changes.","tree":{"sha":"a74a53fa9acdcca4f90bdd2c2fdc20f4f4fa5db4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BitResonant/SoniChain/git/trees/a74a53fa9acdcca4f90bdd2c2fdc20f4f4fa5db4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BitResonant/SoniChain/git/commits/83c31687bc600c9f9e97e731cb54db4a4c31692e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274306202?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BitResonant","id":274306202,"login":"BitResonant","node_id":"U_kgDOEFmUmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BitResonant/SoniChain/commit/83c31687bc600c9f9e97e731cb54db4a4c31692e","node_id":"C_kwDOS9YqDdoAKDgzYzMxNjg3YmM2MDBjOWY5ZTk3ZTczMWNiNTRkYjRhNGMzMTY5MmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BitResonant/SoniChain/commit/800f321466ae3201d2db158934241ccb4e7ce1b1","sha":"800f321466ae3201d2db158934241ccb4e7ce1b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BitResonant/SoniChain/commits/800f321466ae3201d2db158934241ccb4e7ce1b1"}],"sha":"83c31687bc600c9f9e97e731cb54db4a4c31692e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BitResonant/SoniChain/commits/83c31687bc600c9f9e97e731cb54db4a4c31692e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274306202?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BitResonant","id":274306202,"login":"BitResonant","node_id":"U_kgDOEFmUmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BitResonant/SoniChain/commits/800f321466ae3201d2db158934241ccb4e7ce1b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T15:33:49Z","email":"matteo.caruso.linardon@gmail.com","name":"BitResonant"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T15:33:49Z","email":"matteo.caruso.linardon@gmail.com","name":"BitResonant"},"message":"Update chart theme, smoothing & calibration UI\n\nSwitch UI to a warm accent palette and improve chart rendering and calibration UX.\n\nHighlights:\n- Global/theme: replace cool teal tokens with warm amber/brown tones (--accent, --accent-2, warn, borders, text colors, background gradients, and a reusable --glow).\n- AudioControls: update accent colors, slider thumb colors/shadows and dropdown/focus backgrounds to match new palette.\n- CryptoChart:\n  - Add renderBuffer with exponential smoothing (frame-rate independent) to interpolate incoming ticks for a smoother line animation.\n  - Add adaptive price formatting (fmtPrice) and gridStep-based labels instead of percent text.\n  - Improve dynamic vertical padding logic for flat buffers and use real-priced buffers.\n  - Reduce heavy shadowing, tweak pulse sizes, adjust fill/stroke colors to the new palette.\n  - Use ResizeObserver on the chart container instead of window resize listener and position the canvas absolutely to avoid layout inflation.\n  - Various layout/CSS tweaks (padding, min-heights, dot styles, gradients).\n- Page (+page.svelte):\n  - cryptoData now stores actual prices (not normalized); introduce priceBufferInitialized to fill the buffer with the current price on first tick or when asset changes to avoid spurious interpolation.\n  - Reset priceBufferInitialized when changing asset.\n  - Add cancelCalibration() and a Cancel button in the calibration UI, plus updated calibration visuals and styles.\n  - Responsive/layout tweaks (grid columns, min-width/min-height adjustments) to prevent overflow issues.\n\nThese changes aim to provide a warmer visual theme, smoother and more accurate chart rendering for real price data, and a clearer calibration flow with cancel support.","tree":{"sha":"85f22f5b2b6bdf1797d0bc7ce5228aeb24fffb7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BitResonant/SoniChain/git/trees/85f22f5b2b6bdf1797d0bc7ce5228aeb24fffb7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BitResonant/SoniChain/git/commits/800f321466ae3201d2db158934241ccb4e7ce1b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274306202?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BitResonant","id":274306202,"login":"BitResonant","node_id":"U_kgDOEFmUmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BitResonant/SoniChain/commit/800f321466ae3201d2db158934241ccb4e7ce1b1","node_id":"C_kwDOS9YqDdoAKDgwMGYzMjE0NjZhZTMyMDFkMmRiMTU4OTM0MjQxY2NiNGU3Y2UxYjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BitResonant/SoniChain/commit/6cf2430a402d1a40ae228db00da56f6cf4d73ec8","sha":"6cf2430a402d1a40ae228db00da56f6cf4d73ec8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BitResonant/SoniChain/commits/6cf2430a402d1a40ae228db00da56f6cf4d73ec8"}],"sha":"800f321466ae3201d2db158934241ccb4e7ce1b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BitResonant/SoniChain/commits/800f321466ae3201d2db158934241ccb4e7ce1b1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274306202?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BitResonant","id":274306202,"login":"BitResonant","node_id":"U_kgDOEFmUmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BitResonant/SoniChain/commits/6cf2430a402d1a40ae228db00da56f6cf4d73ec8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T14:02:42Z","email":"matteo.caruso.linardon@gmail.com","name":"BitResonant"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T14:02:42Z","email":"matteo.caruso.linardon@gmail.com","name":"BitResonant"},"message":"Redesign UI: fonts, charts, controls, help\n\nAdd global fonts and theme tokens, and overhaul the controls and chart UI with visual and UX improvements. AudioControls.svelte: introduce onHelpHover prop, simplify volume handling, replace raw fader/knob styling with themed faders, add select chevrons, hover/focus help triggers and refined layout/styles. CryptoChart.svelte: rewrite canvas rendering for DPR-aware sizing, smooth Catmull–Rom->Bezier curve tracing, gradient background/area fill, grid, animated head marker, current-value tag, and chart header with asset/status props; performance-minded layout calculations added. src/routes/+page.svelte: add contextual help system, brand/header redesign, recalibration button styling and hints, derive chart asset label/status and wire help hover between controls and help bar. Overall: visual refresh, accessibility/hover affordances for contextual tips, and canvas rendering/perf improvements.","tree":{"sha":"02a36ecb674d2b547481c6725d6a646411c70b45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BitResonant/SoniChain/git/trees/02a36ecb674d2b547481c6725d6a646411c70b45"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BitResonant/SoniChain/git/commits/6cf2430a402d1a40ae228db00da56f6cf4d73ec8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274306202?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BitResonant","id":274306202,"login":"BitResonant","node_id":"U_kgDOEFmUmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BitResonant/SoniChain/commit/6cf2430a402d1a40ae228db00da56f6cf4d73ec8","node_id":"C_kwDOS9YqDdoAKDZjZjI0MzBhNDAyZDFhNDBhZTIyOGRiMDBkYTU2ZjZjZjRkNzNlYzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BitResonant/SoniChain/commit/0f7afdc82a6bb3b5aab72c5cb0a877b7e94bb09f","sha":"0f7afdc82a6bb3b5aab72c5cb0a877b7e94bb09f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BitResonant/SoniChain/commits/0f7afdc82a6bb3b5aab72c5cb0a877b7e94bb09f"}],"sha":"6cf2430a402d1a40ae228db00da56f6cf4d73ec8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BitResonant/SoniChain/commits/6cf2430a402d1a40ae228db00da56f6cf4d73ec8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274306202?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BitResonant","id":274306202,"login":"BitResonant","node_id":"U_kgDOEFmUmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BitResonant/SoniChain/commits/0f7afdc82a6bb3b5aab72c5cb0a877b7e94bb09f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T13:43:32Z","email":"matteo.caruso.linardon@gmail.com","name":"BitResonant"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T13:43:32Z","email":"matteo.caruso.linardon@gmail.com","name":"BitResonant"},"message":"Refactor calibration flow and UI state\n\nIntroduce a CalibrationPhase union and replace boolean flags with a clear state machine for calibration (initial-connecting, pending-calibrate, recal-connecting, calibrating, idle). Add initialConnectTimerDone and initialConnectStreamReady plus maybeShowCalibrate to ensure a minimum 3s \"Connecting...\" display before showing the Calibrate button. Consolidate calibration logic into startCalibration, startCalibrationTimer, triggerRnboRecalibration and triggerCalibration; handle STREAM_READY from the worker to drive initial calibration vs. recalibration flows. Update crypto switch behavior to either start a recalibration or reset the initial-connecting flow, and simplify RNBO parameter calls and UI conditionals (overlay shown based on calibrationPhase). Also fix small UI text and timing/interval cleanup for the 30s calibration progress bar.","tree":{"sha":"a9b696fbca2b8c818b87049c34caf6009f9e6bfe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BitResonant/SoniChain/git/trees/a9b696fbca2b8c818b87049c34caf6009f9e6bfe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BitResonant/SoniChain/git/commits/0f7afdc82a6bb3b5aab72c5cb0a877b7e94bb09f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274306202?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BitResonant","id":274306202,"login":"BitResonant","node_id":"U_kgDOEFmUmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BitResonant","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BitResonant/SoniChain/commit/0f7afdc82a6bb3b5aab72c5cb0a877b7e94bb09f","node_id"