.com/repos/mlbright/ipv6rd/git/trees/2469ea437c6fc52fb1d969dd02f40626498987fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mlbright/ipv6rd/git/commits/27d5274827a719d48a8a1c2a774de74b3c160e86","verification":{"payload":"tree 2469ea437c6fc52fb1d969dd02f40626498987fd\nparent 9c95f16e887ec9cb444ccfed0a8471a1eed9da6c\nauthor Martin-Louis Bright <mbright@cpacketnetworks.com> 1781808124 -0400\ncommitter Martin-Louis Bright <mbright@cpacketnetworks.com> 1781808124 -0400\n\nDefault install-launchd to ~/.local instead of /usr/local\n\nIntroduces MACOS_PREFIX (default $HOME/.local) so the launchd user-agent\ninstall is fully rootless end-to-end.  PREFIX still controls install-systemd.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg3/6C+x0zA56QYYI1srPOTDgVCj\nPE2KY8/Ls7O57qwYYAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQJu7xdMZFKhilpMvdsmjrYakb8GcqY9hM6s3otT25YFNq+oATwNLp+WiHln9lGTpaw\nn9CzqPcNY9HJ8kw166fg0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-18T20:36:40Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91706201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbrightcpacket/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbrightcpacket/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbrightcpacket/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbrightcpacket/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbrightcpacket","id":91706201,"login":"mbrightcpacket","node_id":"U_kgDOBXdTWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbrightcpacket/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbrightcpacket/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbrightcpacket/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbrightcpacket/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"htt