s","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbrightcpacket/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbrightcpacket/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbrightcpacket/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbrightcpacket","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mlbright/ipv6rd/commits/1b8cd2cb2bb7c64cf400a16263051837915f774c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T21:41:42Z","email":"mbright@cpacketnetworks.com","name":"Martin-Louis Bright"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T21:46:18Z","email":"mbright@cpacketnetworks.com","name":"Martin-Louis Bright"},"message":"Re-knock in-process via fwknop-go library with keys from 1Password SDK\n\nAdd a built-in fwknop mode (--fwknop-* flags) that sends the SPA packet\nin process via the fwknop-go library and resolves the encryption/HMAC\nkeys from 1Password through a service-account token, removing the\nfwknop/op/jq runtime dependencies and the shell indirection. Keys are\nresolved once at startup (fail fast on misconfiguration) and cached, so\neach rotation is a pure local encode + UDP send. Generic command mode is\nretained; poke-hole.sh stays as an example.\n\nUpdate the systemd unit to run built-in fwknop mode with an\nOP_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_TOKEN EnvironmentFile, and document both modes in the\nREADME. Record the decision in docs/adr/0002.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ac7df5b966980068fd51df6a54096eb84a2799f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mlbright/ipv6rd/git/trees/ac7df5b966980068fd51df6a54096eb84a2799f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mlbright/ipv6rd/git/commits/1b8cd2cb2bb7c64cf400a16263051837915f774c","verification":{"payload":"tree ac7df5b966980068fd51df6a54096eb84a2799f9\nparent 6541416dece5792a43028f641d2f064930784c93\nauthor Martin-Louis Bright <mbright@cpacketnetworks.com> 1781732502 +0000\ncommitter Martin-Louis Bright <mbright@cpacketnetworks.com> 1781732778 +0000\n\nRe-knock in-process via fwknop-go library with keys from 1Password SDK\n\nAdd a built-in fwknop mode (--fwknop-* flags) that sends the SPA packet\nin process via the fwknop-go library and resolves the encryption/HMAC\nkeys from 1Password through a service-account token, removing the\nfwknop/op/jq runtime dependencies and the shell indirection. Keys are\nresolved once at startup (fail fast on misconfiguration) and cached, so\neach rotation is a pure local encode + UDP send. Generic command mode is\nretained; poke-hole.sh stays as an example.\n\nUpdate the systemd unit to run built-in fwknop mode with an\nOP_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_TOKEN EnvironmentFile, and document both modes in the\nREADME. Record the decision in docs/adr/0002.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgNTlWw6rJhSeXiEDJD2uj3RWERy\nIBwdtaP2G/eSaXNH8AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQGTYvUB64jcx3itE7MIHJPJylT8PP9J6TnIEzRKrWA/afENtN3t4lLfrt07kc1NoFY\nI+4ptLv8VHrrLQdmddOgk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-17T23:22:11Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91706201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbrightcpacket/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbrightcpacket/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbrightcpacket/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbrightcpacket/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbrightcpacket","id":91706201,"login":"mbrightcpacket","node_id":"U_kgDOBXdTWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbrightcpacket/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbrightcpacket/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbrightcpacket/repos","sit