"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T21:40:32Z","email":"mbright@cpacketnetworks.com","name":"Martin-Louis Bright"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T21:40:32Z","email":"mbright@cpacketnetworks.com","name":"Martin-Louis Bright"},"message":"Add Makefile and stop tracking the built binary\n\nAdd a Makefile covering the significant tasks: build, run, install,\ninstall-systemd (rewriting the unit''s ExecStart/User and scaffolding a\n0600 /etc/ipv6rd.env), uninstall-systemd, package (versioned tarball),\nplus vet/fmt/tidy/test/clean. Style matches ../fwknop-go''s Makefile.\n\nUntrack the ./ipv6rd build artifact and gitignore it along with dist/.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c17f04a5c547defb8826eaa23a924cb3dde4f3c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mlbright/ipv6rd/git/trees/c17f04a5c547defb8826eaa23a924cb3dde4f3c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mlbright/ipv6rd/git/commits/6541416dece5792a43028f641d2f064930784c93","verification":{"payload":"tree c17f04a5c547defb8826eaa23a924cb3dde4f3c1\nparent 145e3941ba5b5eb17da9c5a7a0aa52286d136a74\nauthor Martin-Louis Bright <mbright@cpacketnetworks.com> 1781732432 +0000\ncommitter Martin-Louis Bright <mbright@cpacketnetworks.com> 1781732432 +0000\n\nAdd Makefile and stop tracking the built binary\n\nAdd a Makefile covering the significant tasks: build, run, install,\ninstall-systemd (rewriting the unit''s ExecStart/User and scaffolding a\n0600 /etc/ipv6rd.env), uninstall-systemd, package (versioned tarball),\nplus vet/fmt/tidy/test/clean. Style matches ../fwknop-go''s Makefile.\n\nUntrack the ./ipv6rd build artifact and gitignore it along with dist/.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgNTlWw6rJhSeXiEDJD2uj3RWERy\nIBwdtaP2G/eSaXNH8AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQCwAsy2jmeC9dBrInrSdT2POFuRvgrs