laude vision (Llm:Provider=Claude\n+ Llm:Anthropic:ApiKey) -> local stub. Byte-probe attributes are still derived locally; falls\nback to the stub if no content or the call fails.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dc9901d5814b33e4d4e72e92fe65d1c429af80ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShonishBhushanP/insurtech-platform/git/trees/dc9901d5814b33e4d4e72e92fe65d1c429af80ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShonishBhushanP/insurtech-platform/git/commits/bf353daf9671470712ad234505d766cfd1cfbd77","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/255855224?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShonishBhushanP/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShonishBhushanP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShonishBhushanP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShonishBhushanP/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ShonishBhushanP","id":255855224,"login":"ShonishBhushanP","node_id":"U_kgDOD0AKeA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShonishBhushanP/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShonishBhushanP/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShonishBhushanP/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShonishBhushanP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShonishBhushanP/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShonishBhushanP","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ShonishBhushanP/insurtech-platform/commit/bf353daf9671470712ad234505d766cfd1cfbd77","node_id":"C_kwDOS9cTV9oAKGJmMzUzZGFmOTY3MTQ3MDcxMmFkMjM0NTA1ZDc2NmNmZDFjZmJkNzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ShonishBhushanP/insurtech-platform/commit/e14767c5757d9cbfc4f1a151799656b6430a9686",