t.com/u/255855224?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShonishBhushanP/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShonishBhushanP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShonishBhushanP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShonishBhushanP/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ShonishBhushanP","id":255855224,"login":"ShonishBhushanP","node_id":"U_kgDOD0AKeA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShonishBhushanP/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShonishBhushanP/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShonishBhushanP/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShonishBhushanP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShonishBhushanP/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShonishBhushanP","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShonishBhushanP/insurtech-platform/commits/e278c93c29c3247a04c8a5333e4f89e0b6508473/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T09:10:17Z","email":"shonishbhushan.palanisamy@cognizant.com","name":"615416"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T09:10:17Z","email":"shonishbhushan.palanisamy@cognizant.com","name":"615416"},"message":"Same-origin API proxy (bypass corporate proxy block on Container Apps domain) + OCR type-aware fields\n\nBrowser calls to *.azurecontainerapps.io are blocked by the corporate proxy (Zscaler);\nthe *.azurestaticapps.net origin is allowed. Route the API through the SWA''s own origin via\na Static Web Apps linked backend so the browser never calls the Container Apps domain directly.\n\n- Gateway: strip a leading /api segment before routing so /api/v1/... (proxied by the SWA\n  linked backend) matches the existing /v1/... routes; no-op for direct /v1 calls.\n- Frontend (deployed): VITE_API_BASE=/api -> same-origin requests proxied to the gateway.\n- staticwebapp.config.json: exclude /api/* from navigationFallback so API calls reach the\n  linked backend instead of being rewritten to index.html.\n- OCR stub: classify the document from file name + sensitivity class and emit fields\n  appropriate to the type (DeathCertificate, MedicalReport, Property/Motor damage, IdProof,\n  Invoice, generic photo) instead of always returning vehicle-damage data.\n- FileClaim: label image attachments by claim type (Life->DeathCertificate, Health->MedicalDocument, etc.).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c59eeb4dc931e196e31e1a971f14e2d0be48ab09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShonishBhushanP/insurtech-platform/git/trees/c59eeb4dc931e196e31e1a971f14e2d0be48ab09"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShonishBhushanP/insurtech-platform/git/commits/e278c93c29c3247a04c8a5333e4f89e0b6508473","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/255855224?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShonishBhushanP/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShonishBhushanP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShonishBhushanP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShonishBhushanP/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ShonishBhushanP","id":255855224,"login":"ShonishBhushanP","node_id":"U_kgDOD0AKeA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShonishBhushanP/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShonishBhushanP/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShonishBhushanP/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShonishBhushanP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShonishBhushanP/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShonishBhushanP","user