 Implemented recurring transactions management including creation, updating, and deletion.\n- Added UI components for displaying and interacting with recurring transactions.\n- Introduced a new hook `useRecurringTransactions` for handling API interactions related to recurring transactions.\n- Enhanced `TransactionCard` to display a badge for recurring transactions.\n- Created a new `RecurringSyncProvider` to manage sync state across the application.\n- Added error handling and loading states for recurring transactions.\n- Updated styles for new components and added skeleton loading states.\n- Modified existing transaction handling to support navigation to recurring transactions.\n- Updated shared types to include recurring transaction definitions.","tree":{"sha":"42e79edafcb619b35848c3ad36358f04aa433870","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saulm96/mercury-environment/git/trees/42e79edafcb619b35848c3ad36358f04aa433870"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saulm96/mercury-environment/git/commits/b4315a916078717a816cfaea0b45a205287601e4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67784218?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saulm96/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saulm96/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saulm96/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saulm96/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/saulm96","id":67784218,"login":"saulm96","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Nzg0MjE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saulm96/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saulm96/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saulm96/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saulm96/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saulm96/subscripti