a20188e77a0288e8a68a","node_id":"C_kwDOS-AkDdoAKGI1MDE4MDlmM2E2NmQzOTE5NjlhYTIwMTg4ZTc3YTAyODhlOGE2OGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commit/341899c4b9d45fc3e147fc4dec55d192e93e5fda","sha":"341899c4b9d45fc3e147fc4dec55d192e93e5fda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/341899c4b9d45fc3e147fc4dec55d192e93e5fda"}],"sha":"b501809f3a66d391969aa20188e77a0288e8a68a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/b501809f3a66d391969aa20188e77a0288e8a68a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39896565?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447","id":39896565,"login":"chandra447","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5ODk2NTY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/341899c4b9d45fc3e147fc4dec55d192e93e5fda/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T20:24:42Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T20:24:42Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"message":"Fix distributed tracing: propagate session in baggage + close push-callback loop\n\nTwo issues were breaking the ''one session per conversation'' guarantee:\n\n1. Specialist spans landed in a SEPARATE session. Root cause:\n   enrich_span_context(session_id=...) only sets session_id as a span\n   *attribute*, but the HoneyHive span processor stamps every child span by\n   reading the OTel baggage key ''honeyhive.session_id''. Nothing put the\n   session into baggage, so it never propagated to child spans OR across the\n   A2A boundary via inject_context_into_carrier.\n\n   Fix: app/tracing.attach_session_to_context() puts both ''session_id'' and\n   ''honeyhive.session_id'' into the current baggage. GraphSession._trace_context\n   now nests it inside enrich_span_context so the orchestrator''s own\n   router/responder/synthesizer spans AND the outbound A2A inject carry the\n   session. _build_trace_call_context re-attaches defensively in case the\n   background dispatch task didn''t inherit the driver context.\n\n2. The push-notification callback didn''t carry the session back, so the\n   orchestrator''s webhook resume processing happened outside the trace.\n   with_distributed_trace_context was only used on the specialist receive\n   side, not on the orchestrator webhook receive side.\n\n   Fix:\n   - nimbus_a2a/server.py: _TracingPushNotificationSender subclasses\n     BasePushNotificationSender and injects the current W3C traceparent +\n     HoneyHive session baggage into the callback POST headers. The push\n     producer task inherits the baggage from the receive middleware, so the\n     callback carries the session the specialist received.\n   - orchestrator/service.py: the /a2a/callback webhook now wraps handling in\n     session._callback_trace_context(request) -> with_distributed_trace_context\n     (with session_id passed explicitly as a safety net), so relaying chunks\n     + resuming the graph interrupt join the original trace + session.\n\nVerified end-to-end:\n- Round-trip test: orchestrator injects baggage with session_id +\n  honeyhive.session_id; specialist with_distributed_trace_context extracts\n  both; span processor reads honeyhive.session_id == expected session. MATCH.\n- Routed request (travel + nutrition): callback POSTs to /a2a/callback carry\n  traceparent (consistent trace id across pushes) + baggage with\n  session_id == expected conversation session. 11K-char response, no errors.\n- Logs clean (no callback errors, no push-notification errors).","tree":{"sha":"9cab992b1bbaf6a3a5580b4c2fdbb32f54ea4b83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/git/trees/9cab992b1bbaf6a3a5580b4c2fdbb32f54ea4b83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/git/commits/341899c4b9d45fc3e147fc4dec55d192e93e5fda","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39896565?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447","id":39896565,"login":"chandra447","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5ODk2NTY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commit/341899c4b9d45fc3e147fc4dec55d192e93e5fda","node_id":"C_kwDOS-AkDdoAKDM0MTg5OWM0YjlkNDVmYzNlMTQ3ZmM0ZGVjNTVkMTkyZTkzZTVmZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commit/b6f73af00b8f51ceee4dbb62b34fef13fb31f97a","sha":"b6f73af00b8f51ceee4dbb62b34fef13fb31f97a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/b6f73af00b8f51ceee4dbb62b34fef13fb31f97a"}],"sha":"341899c4b9d45fc3e147fc4dec55d192e93e5fda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/341899c4b9d45fc3e147fc4dec55d192e93e5fda"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39896565?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447","id":39896565,"login":"chandra447","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5ODk2NTY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/b6f73af00b8f51ceee4dbb62b34fef13fb31f97a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T12:12:00Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T12:12:00Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"message":"Add distributed tracing to HoneyHive across orchestrator + specialists\n\nOne HoneyHive session per conversation (deterministic UUID5 of context_id),\nwith specialist spans linked as children of the orchestrator''s dispatch span\nvia W3C trace context propagation over A2A. LangChain is auto-instrumented\nvia openinference-langchain; A2A''s own tracing is disabled so only LangChain\ntraces flow to HoneyHive.\n\nTracing module (app/tracing.py):\n  - get_tracer(source): lazy per-service HoneyHiveTracer init, instruments\n    LangChain once globally, disables A2A tracing\n  - session_id_for(context_id): deterministic UUID5 so every turn + specialist\n    delegation in a conversation lands in the same session\n  - is_tracing_enabled(): env-gated no-op when HH_API_KEY absent\n  - suppresses known OpenInferenceTracer+LangGraph interrupt callback errors\n    (openinference #3231) by raising logger to ERROR level\n\nOrchestrator (session.py):\n  - GraphSession wraps each turn in enrich_span_context(session_id=...)\n    so router/responder/synthesizer LangChain spans all carry the session\n  - _send_specialist_request wraps in enrich_span_context(''call_specialist'')\n    and injects W3C traceparent + HoneyHive session baggage into the A2A\n    request headers via ClientCallContext.service_parameters\n\nSDK (nimbus_a2a/server.py):\n  - create_specialist_app(..., tracer=...) optional param\n  - FastAPI middleware enters with_distributed_trace_context(headers, tracer)\n    on every request so specialist LangChain spans become children of the\n    orchestrator''s dispatch span, same session\n\nWiring:\n  - docker-compose.yml: env_file: backend/.env on all 3 services (loads\n    HH_API_KEY/HH_PROJECT/HH_ENABLE_TRACING/OTEL_INSTRUMENTATION_A2A_SDK_ENABLED)\n  - settings.py: HH_API_KEY, HH_PROJECT, HH_ENABLE_TRACING fields\n  - app/specialist/service.py passes get_tracer(f''specialist:{prefix}'')\n\nVerified: routed request (travel+nutrition) with real HH key — spans exported\nto HoneyHive project NIMBUS, logs clean (no callback errors), session_id\ndeterministic. Tracing-disabled path (no key) is a graceful no-op.\n\ndocs/tracing.md: full architecture diagram, env vars, SDK team guide.","tree":{"sha":"4089627de77b2d572739a0b18ae43e05b14559b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/git/trees/4089627de77b2d572739a0b18ae43e05b14559b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/git/commits/b6f73af00b8f51ceee4dbb62b34fef13fb31f97a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39896565?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447","id":39896565,"login":"chandra447","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5ODk2NTY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commit/b6f73af00b8f51ceee4dbb62b34fef13fb31f97a","node_id":"C_kwDOS-AkDdoAKGI2ZjczYWYwMGI4ZjUxY2VlZTRkYmI2MmIzNGZlZjEzZmIzMWY5N2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commit/3492e478512e259a9ed92188d1996cdc584a9d90","sha":"3492e478512e259a9ed92188d1996cdc584a9d90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/3492e478512e259a9ed92188d1996cdc584a9d90"}],"sha":"b6f73af00b8f51ceee4dbb62b34fef13fb31f97a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/b6f73af00b8f51ceee4dbb62b34fef13fb31f97a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39896565?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447","id":39896565,"login":"chandra447","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5ODk2NTY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/3492e478512e259a9ed92188d1996cdc584a9d90/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T11:26:49Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T11:26:49Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"message":"Make orchestrator router system prompt fully generic\n\nThe router no longer hardcodes travel/nutrition domains. It now decides which\nspecialist(s) to route to based solely on the registered specialist agent cards\nthat RegisteredSpecialistPromptMiddleware injects as context (name, URL, skills,\ntags, examples). The middleware already tells the model to prefer routing when a\nspecialist is relevant, so the router prompt just needs the generic rules:\nselect every relevant specialist for parallel fan-out, set should_route=false if\nnone are relevant, and the needs_synthesis guidance.\n\nThis makes the orchestrator work with any set of specialists registered at\nruntime — no prompt edits needed to add a new specialist domain.","tree":{"sha":"8828b73e03971c8fbda1a435e988f36eed72a732","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/git/trees/8828b73e03971c8fbda1a435e988f36eed72a732"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/git/commits/3492e478512e259a9ed92188d1996cdc584a9d90","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39896565?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447","id":39896565,"login":"chandra447","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5ODk2NTY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commit/3492e478512e259a9ed92188d1996cdc584a9d90","node_id":"C_kwDOS-AkDdoAKDM0OTJlNDc4NTEyZTI1OWE5ZWQ5MjE4OGQxOTk2Y2RjNTg0YTlkOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commit/c5ee9b0e9b14c8ed0e4fd537089c97f9734f6580","sha":"c5ee9b0e9b14c8ed0e4fd537089c97f9734f6580","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/c5ee9b0e9b14c8ed0e4fd537089c97f9734f6580"}],"sha":"3492e478512e259a9ed92188d1996cdc584a9d90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/3492e478512e259a9ed92188d1996cdc584a9d90"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39896565?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447","id":39896565,"login":"chandra447","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5ODk2NTY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/c5ee9b0e9b14c8ed0e4fd537089c97f9734f6580/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T10:57:21Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T10:57:21Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"message":"Add copy button to each chat message block\n\nHover any user or assistant message to reveal a Copy button in its header.\nCopies the full message content to the clipboard and shows a ''Copied'' check\nfor 2s. Assistant copy button only appears once streaming finishes and there\nis content.","tree":{"sha":"568c008a4fb9b03009c89d1ca6dbc29fabee8506","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/git/trees/568c008a4fb9b03009c89d1ca6dbc29fabee8506"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/git/commits/c5ee9b0e9b14c8ed0e4fd537089c97f9734f6580","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39896565?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447","id":39896565,"login":"chandra447","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5ODk2NTY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commit/c5ee9b0e9b14c8ed0e4fd537089c97f9734f6580","node_id":"C_kwDOS-AkDdoAKGM1ZWU5YjBlOWIxNGM4ZWQwZTRmZDUzNzA4OWM5N2Y5NzM0ZjY1ODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commit/0e31ee3fb3dd9e9ef69ac9a266c5e53ccb9aa7fe","sha":"0e31ee3fb3dd9e9ef69ac9a266c5e53ccb9aa7fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/0e31ee3fb3dd9e9ef69ac9a266c5e53ccb9aa7fe"}],"sha":"c5ee9b0e9b14c8ed0e4fd537089c97f9734f6580","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/c5ee9b0e9b14c8ed0e4fd537089c97f9734f6580"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39896565?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447","id":39896565,"login":"chandra447","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5ODk2NTY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/0e31ee3fb3dd9e9ef69ac9a266c5e53ccb9aa7fe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T10:41:04Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T10:41:04Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"message":"Make nimbus_a2a a pure abstraction + split specialists into folders\n\nSDK is now framework-agnostic: teams subclass SpecialistExecutor, override\ninvoke() or stream() with any framework (LangChain, LangGraph, Pydantic AI,\nDSPy, raw LLM calls), bring their own AgentCard, and call\ncreate_specialist_app(executor, card, server=...) to get a FastAPI app. The SDK\nowns all A2A protocol, task lifecycle, and return_immediately push-notification\nchunking (streaming vs non-streaming). Adds startup()/shutdown() lifecycle hooks\nfor async resource setup. No more LangChain/Tavily assumptions in the SDK.\n\nApp-level LangChain+Tavily framework lives in app/specialist/ (built ON the SDK):\n  - config.py      shared SpecialistConfig/SpecialistSkillSpec dataclasses\n  - executor.py    LangChainSpecialistExecutor (subclasses SDK, implements stream)\n  - agent_card.py  build_specialist_agent_card helper\n  - tavily.py      build_tavily_research_tool (LangChain tool)\n  - service.py     create_specialist_app wiring (model+checkpointer+executor+card)\n  - __init__.py    SPECIALIST_CONFIGS registry + get_specialist_config\n\nEach specialist now has its own folder:\n  - travel/    __init__.py + config.py (travel_config, streaming=True)\n  - nutrition/ __init__.py + config.py (nutrition_config, streaming=False)\n\nVerified end-to-end: travel streams 10 incremental chunks, nutrition sends 1\nfinal artifact, orchestrator produces 13K-char response.","tree":{"sha":"3bcadb356291690daba1b4e314518cf5ddc64a30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/git/trees/3bcadb356291690daba1b4e314518cf5ddc64a30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/git/commits/0e31ee3fb3dd9e9ef69ac9a266c5e53ccb9aa7fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39896565?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447","id":39896565,"login":"chandra447","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5ODk2NTY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commit/0e31ee3fb3dd9e9ef69ac9a266c5e53ccb9aa7fe","node_id":"C_kwDOS-AkDdoAKDBlMzFlZTNmYjNkZDllOWVmNjlhYzlhMjY2YzVlNTNjY2I5YWE3ZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commit/9bf986a43143ad9e1833b5eb91d72c84e1c868b6","sha":"9bf986a43143ad9e1833b5eb91d72c84e1c868b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/9bf986a43143ad9e1833b5eb91d72c84e1c868b6"}],"sha":"0e31ee3fb3dd9e9ef69ac9a266c5e53ccb9aa7fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/0e31ee3fb3dd9e9ef69ac9a266c5e53ccb9aa7fe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39896565?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447","id":39896565,"login":"chandra447","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5ODk2NTY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/9bf986a43143ad9e1833b5eb91d72c84e1c868b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T10:18:26Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T10:18:26Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"message":"Extract nimbus_a2a SDK for building A2A specialists\n\nA clean, reusable SDK so N specialists can be built from config, hiding all\nA2A server + push-notification + streaming/non-streaming plumbing.\n\nNEW PACKAGE: backend/nimbus_a2a/\n  - config.py     — SpecialistConfig (with  flag),\n                    SpecialistSkillSpec\n  - executor.py   — SpecialistExecutor: runs a LangChain agent; streaming=True\n                    pushes buffered incremental artifact chunks via push\n                    notifications, streaming=False accumulates and pushes ONE\n                    final artifact (minimal notifications, no live preview)\n  - agent_card.py — build_agent_card: advertises  capability from\n                    config, push_notifications=True always\n  - server.py     — create_specialist_app(config, server, model,\n                    checkpointer_factory): assembles FastAPI + A2A server with\n                    BasePushNotificationSender wired in (return_immediately\n                    background push). SpecialistServerConfig holds runtime\n                    wiring (db_url, urls, cors, tavily) separate from agent def\n  - tools.py      — build_tavily_research_tool\n  - __init__.py   — public API\n\nAPP WIRING (app/specialist/):\n  - service.py: thin adapter — builds model + checkpointer_factory from app\n    settings, delegates to SDK\n  - configs.py: imports from nimbus_a2a; travel streaming=True, nutrition\n    streaming=False (showcases both modes)\n  - Removed obsolete builder.py, executor.py, tavily.py, workflow.py,\n    agent_card.py (all moved into the SDK)\n\nPATTERN: orchestrator submits SendMessage(return_immediately=True) + push\nconfig → specialist returns task_id instantly, works in background, POSTs\nevents to /a2a/callback. Streaming specialists push incremental chunks;\nnon-streaming push one final artifact. Orchestrator correlates via callback\ntoken → interrupt_id and resumes the paused LangGraph interrupt.\n\nVERIFIED:\n  - travel (streaming=True): 16 incremental chunk events (live preview)\n  - nutrition (streaming=False): 1 chunk event (single 6221-char final response)\n  - agent cards advertise correct streaming capability","tree":{"sha":"aaab3d7d24ad3fe0c8a59ec147a06254f3e12aec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/git/trees/aaab3d7d24ad3fe0c8a59ec147a06254f3e12aec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/git/commits/9bf986a43143ad9e1833b5eb91d72c84e1c868b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39896565?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447","id":39896565,"login":"chandra447","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5ODk2NTY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commit/9bf986a43143ad9e1833b5eb91d72c84e1c868b6","node_id":"C_kwDOS-AkDdoAKDliZjk4NmE0MzE0M2FkOWUxODMzYjVlYjkxZDcyYzg0ZTFjODY4YjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commit/0490f86dd19dea75fb4598d87fd2e4d5b9f19e1e","sha":"0490f86dd19dea75fb4598d87fd2e4d5b9f19e1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/0490f86dd19dea75fb4598d87fd2e4d5b9f19e1e"}],"sha":"9bf986a43143ad9e1833b5eb91d72c84e1c868b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/9bf986a43143ad9e1833b5eb91d72c84e1c868b6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39896565?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447","id":39896565,"login":"chandra447","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5ODk2NTY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/0490f86dd19dea75fb4598d87fd2e4d5b9f19e1e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T09:27:24Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T09:27:24Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"message":"Fix glass preview auto-scroll + no-cache index.html\n\n- Bug: previewRef was on the outer viewport div (overflow-hidden, not\n  scrollable). Moved it to the inner overflow-y-auto div so scrollTop\n  actually scrolls the streaming text to the bottom as new buffers arrive.\n- nginx.conf: index.html now sends no-store/no-cache so new bundle hashes\n  are always picked up (fixes stale-build confusion). Hashed /assets/ are\n  cached immutable.","tree":{"sha":"3f4f76c1d5743de13d3c33804dd23adeb970355d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/git/trees/3f4f76c1d5743de13d3c33804dd23adeb970355d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/git/commits/0490f86dd19dea75fb4598d87fd2e4d5b9f19e1e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_ur