:39896565,"login":"chandra447","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5ODk2NTY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/cfaab430fb0dbee34e869020ec0935edb5799fde/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T09:20:50Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T09:20:50Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"message":"Glass preview: no auto-expand, animated highlight on latest buffer\n\n- Removed auto-expand of the activity log (manual expand only via chevron).\n  The glass preview is always shown when active/streaming; the events log\n  is hidden until the user clicks to expand.\n- Redesigned preview as a fixed-height (120px) auto-scrolling glass viewport:\n  • Gradient mask fades old text (top → transparent) and keeps the latest\n    buffer bright/highlighted at the bottom — ''seeing through glass'' effect.\n  • Bottom blue glow emphasizes the newest data.\n  • Animated diagonal light sweep (iOS glass reflection) loops periodically.\n  • Blinking cursor at the end of the latest text while live.\n  • Auto-scrolls to bottom as new buffers arrive; scrollbar hidden.\n  • ''Waiting for specialist response…'' shimmer placeholder before chunks.\n- Text color bumped to zinc-100 so the highlighted (latest) region pops.","tree":{"sha":"25bcbc78f376b7ab8eeae9186a060c623b0f7691","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/git/trees/25bcbc78f376b7ab8eeae9186a060c623b0f7691"},"url":"https://ap