ollowers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447","id":39896565,"login":"chandra447","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5ODk2NTY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/93ef27d419eca49b0460ee137f91ccffe5748186/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T09:10:06Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T09:10:06Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"message":"Glassmorphism activity trail + larger specialist buffer\n\nUI — ActivityTrail redesigned as iOS-style frosted glass panel:\n- backdrop-blur-2xl + backdrop-saturate-150 + translucent bg + soft shadow\n- Live auto-scrolling preview of streaming specialist text (collapsed):\n  shows the latest ~84px of each specialist''s raw response with a top\n  fade-to-transparent gradient, auto-scrolls to bottom as chunks arrive\n- Expand to see the full ''Activity'' log (all status/route/search events\n  with hover states) — ''what''s happening behind the scenes''\n- Per-specialist labeled blocks in the preview with monospace text\n- Polished header: glass icon tile, violet specialist pill, live badge\n- Smooth height/opacity transitions on expand/collapse\n\nBackend — specialist buffer increased:\n- FLUSH_CHARS 1200 → 2000, FLUSH_INTERVAL 1.5s → 2.0s\n- ~18-28 chunk POSTs per specialist (was ~thousands originally)\n\nVERIFIED: fan-out shows 18+28 POSTs, ~10K chars live preview text, clean","tree":{"sha":"1cf549d1fbf79df79148d2f8c39a72188be89ca9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/git/trees/1cf549d1fbf79df79148d2f8c39a72188be89ca9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/git/commits/93ef27d419eca49b0460ee137f91ccffe5748186","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39896565?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447","id":39896565,"login":"chandra447","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5ODk2NTY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commit/93ef27d419eca49b0460ee137f91ccffe5748186","node_id":"C_kwDOS-AkDdoAKDkzZWYyN2Q0MTllY2E0OWIwNDYwZWUxMzdmOTFjY2ZmZTU3NDgxODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commit/a05e7c7d168bbf6a117ae3b1fc7b0c3a60598fae","sha":"a05e7c7d168bbf6a117ae3b1fc7b0c3a60598fae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/a05e7c7d168bbf6a117ae3b1fc7b0c3a60598fae"}],"sha":"93ef27d419eca49b0460ee137f91ccffe5748186","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/93ef27d419eca49b0460ee137f91ccffe5748186"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39896565?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447","id":39896565,"login":"chandra447","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5ODk2NTY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/a05e7c7d168bbf6a117ae3b1fc7b0c3a60598fae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T08:56:09Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T08:56:09Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"message":"Fix specialist chunk flooding: batch tokens + group frontend events\n\nPROBLEM:\n- Specialist streamed one artifact chunk per LLM token → thousands of HTTP\n  POSTs to the orchestrator webhook per specialist (100 specialists = disaster)\n- Frontend created one activity-trail event per chunk (3903 events showing\n  ''Nimbus Nutritionist chunk: is a'') — unusable noise\n\nFIX 1 — specialist executor (builder.py): buffered artifact writing\n- Buffer LLM tokens, flush to add_artifact (→ push notification POST) only\n  when buffer > 1200 chars OR 1.5s elapsed OR on completion\n- Result: ~12-24 chunk POSTs per specialist (was ~thousands)\n\nFIX 2 — frontend (home-page.tsx): grouped live-stream events\n- ChatMessage.specialistStreams: Record<string,string> accumulates raw text\n  per specialist\n- One rolling ''artifact'' activity event per specialist, detail shows a\n  growing 140-char preview (''Specialist is responding'')\n- specialist_done status flips the event to ''Specialist responded · complete''\n- Activity trail now shows a clean per-specialist progress line instead of\n  thousands of chunk events\n\nVERIFIED: 49→12 POSTs (Paris), 94→24 + 50→2 POSTs (Tokyo fan-out)","tree":{"sha":"48f84cceaf631ef572776dab8c7d75e9c6411a4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/git/trees/48f84cceaf631ef572776dab8c7d75e9c6411a4c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/git/commits/a05e7c7d168bbf6a117ae3b1fc7b0c3a60598fae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39896565?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447","id":39896565,"login":"chandra447","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5ODk2NTY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commit/a05e7c7d168bbf6a117ae3b1fc7b0c3a60598fae","node_id":"C_kwDOS-AkDdoAKGEwNWU3YzdkMTY4YmJmNmExMTdhZTNiMWZjN2IwYzNhNjA1OThmYWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commit/c30d78d8642981a5204cd50f27ced44ca8f0418d","sha":"c30d78d8642981a5204cd50f27ced44ca8f0418d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/c30d78d8642981a5204cd50f27ced44ca8f0418d"}],"sha":"a05e7c7d168bbf6a117ae3b1fc7b0c3a60598fae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/a05e7c7d168bbf6a117ae3b1fc7b0c3a60598fae"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39896565?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447","id":39896565,"login":"chandra447","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5ODk2NTY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/c30d78d8642981a5204cd50f27ced44ca8f0418d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T08:38:13Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T08:38:13Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"message":"Update docs for LangGraph StateGraph + interrupt + plain SSE architecture\n\n- README: new architecture/sequence/routing diagrams (StateGraph, interrupt pause,\n  Command(resume), SSE event flow), updated message-flow (plain SSE, no A2A SDK),\n  graph lifecycle state diagram, fan-out section (interrupts + push notifications),\n  env table (removed ASYNC_SPECIALIST_MODE), project structure, tech stack\n- docs/architecture.md: component diagram (GraphSession driver, webhook, no A2A server),\n  rewrote Orchestrator Internals (StateGraph nodes, pure specialist_wait, driver loop,\n  three agents, per-turn thread isolation)\n- docs/a2a-protocol.md: intro (frontend is plain SSE, A2A only orchestrator↔specialist),\n  streaming flow (interrupt + push + partial resume), frontend SSE client, push-notifications\n  section (GraphSession/SessionRegistry, Command(resume)), context IDs (per-turn graph thread)\n- docs/development.md: key-files table (graph.py, session.py, chat-stream.ts)\n- .env.example: removed ASYNC_SPECIALIST_MODE","tree":{"sha":"e49133b1124c4ba7f2de51ddf9004d3fa08fe403","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/git/trees/e49133b1124c4ba7f2de51ddf9004d3fa08fe403"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/git/commits/c30d78d8642981a5204cd50f27ced44ca8f0418d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39896565?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447","id":39896565,"login":"chandra447","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5ODk2NTY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commit/c30d78d8642981a5204cd50f27ced44ca8f0418d","node_id":"C_kwDOS-AkDdoAKGMzMGQ3OGQ4NjQyOTgxYTUyMDRjZDUwZjI3Y2VkNDRjYThmMDQxOGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commit/87bdf4c45e93d2253da402d58ab8a18d4479735e","sha":"87bdf4c45e93d2253da402d58ab8a18d4479735e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/87bdf4c45e93d2253da402d58ab8a18d4479735e"}],"sha":"c30d78d8642981a5204cd50f27ced44ca8f0418d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/c30d78d8642981a5204cd50f27ced44ca8f0418d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39896565?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447","id":39896565,"login":"chandra447","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5ODk2NTY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/87bdf4c45e93d2253da402d58ab8a18d4479735e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T08:27:38Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T08:27:38Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"message":"Refactor orchestrator to LangGraph StateGraph with interrupts + plain SSE frontend\n\nMAJOR ARCHITECTURE CHANGE: the orchestrator is no longer an A2A server.\n\nORCHESTRATOR (backend):\n- Now a LangGraph StateGraph (graph.py) checkpointed to SQLite:\n  route → (respond | specialist_wait fan-out via Send) → synthesize|assemble\n- specialist_wait node is a PURE interrupt() — no side effects before it\n  (LangGraph re-runs nodes on resume). The A2A send happens in the driver\n  AFTER the graph pauses.\n- Multiple specialists = multiple interrupts; resumed one at a time as each\n  specialist posts back (partial resume, graph re-pauses between).\n- session.py: GraphSession driver loop runs graph.astream(stream_mode=\n  [''updates'',''custom'']); on pause, dispatches A2A SendMessage(return_immediately=\n  true, push_config) per interrupt; waits on resume_queue; webhook pushes\n  Command(resume={interrupt_id: response}) as specialists complete.\n- service.py: POST /api/chat (SSE stream of status/token/specialist_chunk/\n  done events), POST /a2a/callback webhook (relays push notifications +\n  resumes graph). Removed all A2A server routes.\n- Token streaming via langgraph get_stream_writer (custom stream mode).\n- Removed executor.py, callback.py, agent_card.py (obsolete).\n\nFRONTEND:\n- Removed @a2a-js/sdk dependency entirely.\n- New chat-stream.ts: plain fetch POST /api/chat + SSE parser (async generator).\n- home-page.tsx: consumes new event format (status/token/specialist_chunk/\n  done/error). Activity trail shows live specialist chunks via push notifications.\n- Removed a2a.ts, a2a-helpers.ts.\n\nSETTINGS:\n- Removed ASYNC_SPECIALIST_MODE (always interrupt+push now).\n- Kept ORCHESTRATOR_INTERNAL_URL for specialist webhook callbacks.\n\nVERIFIED end-to-end:\n- Direct response (0 specialists → respond node)\n- Single specialist (interrupt + push resume → assemble)\n- Parallel fan-out no-synthesis (2 interrupts, partial resume → assemble)\n- Parallel fan-out synthesis (2 interrupts → synthesize, unified answer)\n- SQLite checkpointing persists paused interrupt states (211+ rows)\n- CORS preflight passes for browser→orchestrator","tree":{"sha":"37eaf1a0de2d438b66db26f65cd01492af3286a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/git/trees/37eaf1a0de2d438b66db26f65cd01492af3286a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/git/commits/87bdf4c45e93d2253da402d58ab8a18d4479735e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39896565?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447","id":39896565,"login":"chandra447","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5ODk2NTY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commit/87bdf4c45e93d2253da402d58ab8a18d4479735e","node_id":"C_kwDOS-AkDdoAKDg3YmRmNGM0NWU5M2QyMjUzZGE0MDJkNThhYjhhMThkNDQ3OTczNWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commit/ddddc15ae57a136116a07523943a455e401c472e","sha":"ddddc15ae57a136116a07523943a455e401c472e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/ddddc15ae57a136116a07523943a455e401c472e"}],"sha":"87bdf4c45e93d2253da402d58ab8a18d4479735e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/87bdf4c45e93d2253da402d58ab8a18d4479735e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39896565?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447","id":39896565,"login":"chandra447","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5ODk2NTY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/ddddc15ae57a136116a07523943a455e401c472e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T07:05:22Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T07:05:22Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"message":"Update docs for async push-notification pattern\n\n- README: new architecture diagram with webhook/callback flow, updated sequence\n  diagram showing return_immediately + push notifications, routing flowchart with\n  needs_synthesis branch, new Parallel Fan-Out section, env vars table, project\n  structure with callback.py\n- docs/architecture.md: updated executor flowchart, added Async Push-Notification\n  Pattern section with sequence diagram, updated RouteDecision model docs\n- docs/a2a-protocol.md: updated streaming sequence diagram for async mode, added\n  Push Notifications (Async Callback Pattern) section with components table and\n  request configuration example\n- docs/development.md: added callback.py to key files table\n- .env.example: ASYNC_SPECIALIST_MODE, ORCHESTRATOR_INTERNAL_URL","tree":{"sha":"0be662e8708ed7d0eafb044be3c621e3970f6d95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/git/trees/0be662e8708ed7d0eafb044be3c621e3970f6d95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/git/commits/ddddc15ae57a136116a07523943a455e401c472e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39896565?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447","id":39896565,"login":"chandra447","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5ODk2NTY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commit/ddddc15ae57a136116a07523943a455e401c472e","node_id":"C_kwDOS-AkDdoAKGRkZGRjMTVhZTU3YTEzNjExNmEwNzUyMzk0M2E0NTVlNDAxYzQ3MmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commit/405bd5be64705a81db3955b7fc0178b2b3f4bab3","sha":"405bd5be64705a81db3955b7fc0178b2b3f4bab3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/405bd5be64705a81db3955b7fc0178b2b3f4bab3"}],"sha":"ddddc15ae57a136116a07523943a455e401c472e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/ddddc15ae57a136116a07523943a455e401c472e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39896565?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chandra447","id":39896565,"login":"chandra447","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5ODk2NTY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/405bd5be64705a81db3955b7fc0178b2b3f4bab3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T06:48:02Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T06:48:02Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"message":"Refactor to A2A push-notification async pattern — no held SSE connections to specialists\n\nARCHITECTURE CHANGE:\n- Orchestrator now uses return_immediately=True + push notifications when\n  calling specialists (configurable via ASYNC_SPECIALIST_MODE, default true)\n- Specialist processes task in background, POSTs events to orchestrator\n  webhook at /a2a/callback (StreamResponse JSON + X-A2A-Notification-Token header)\n- Orchestrator''s CallbackManager routes webhook events to asyncio.Queue\n  per callback token, executor consumes from queue\n- No long-held A2A SSE connection between orchestrator and specialist\n\nNEW FILES:\n- backend/app/orchestrator/callback.py: CallbackManager (token → asyncio.Queue registry)\n\nMODIFIED:\n- backend/app/settings.py: ASYNC_SPECIALIST_MODE, ORCHESTRATOR_INTERNAL_URL settings\n- backend/app/orchestrator/service.py: webhook endpoint /a2a/callback + callback_manager\n- backend/app/orchestrator/executor.py: _call_specialist_async (return_immediately + push)\n  branches on async_specialist_mode, _call_specialist_streaming (legacy SSE fallback)\n- backend/app/specialist/service.py: BasePushNotificationSender wired to DefaultRequestHandler\n- backend/app/specialist/builder.py: pushNotifications=True in agent card capabilities\n- docker-compose.yml: ORCHESTRATOR_INTERNAL_URL, ASYNC_SPECIALIST_MODE env vars\n\nVERIFIED:\n- Single specialist: async return_immediately + push notifications ✅\n- Parallel fan-out: both specialists async, push events via webhook ✅\n- No-synthesis path: section headers, saved tokens ✅\n- 15 push-notification POSTs to /a2a/callback, all 200 OK ✅","tree":{"sha":"9641e1629614f2cefdeae3da5ebed3ce9a97b53c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/git/trees/9641e1629614f2cefdeae3da5ebed3ce9a97b53c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/git/commits/405bd5be64705a81db3955b7fc0178b2b3f4bab3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39896565?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.