//api.github.com/users/chandra447/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/1a74be49a1e1c215a02a6f780b836dff338eba8b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T06:22:20Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T06:22:20Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"message":"Add needs_synthesis flag to router — skip synthesizer LLM call when specialists address independent aspects\n\n- RouteDecision now includes needs_synthesis: bool\n- Router prompt instructs: true when advice overlaps/conflicts, false when independent\n- Default to false (saves tokens) per community best practices\n- _fan_out_no_synthesis: streams each specialist response directly with section headers (## Specialist Name), no extra LLM call, uses asyncio.as_completed for streaming as-ready\n- _fan_out_with_synthesis: original behavior (collect all, synthesizer LLM, stream unified)\n- Verified: independent query → no synthesis, section headers, saved tokens; overlapping query → synthesis, unified response","tree":{"sha":"0f85d599af0637b44e8c833aa423a50a61bd5e82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/git/trees/0f85d599af0637b44e8c833aa423a50a61bd5e82"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/git/commits/1a74be49a1e1c215a02a6f780b836dff338eba8b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39896565?v=4","events_