rganizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chandra447","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/commits/3a9f9239f1e794779ef6d167064b39b5e3988a23/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T05:35:56Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T05:35:56Z","email":"dchandrateja@gmail.com","name":"Chandra Doredla"},"message":"Initial commit: Nimbus Chat — A2A multi-agent orchestrator with parallel fan-out\n\n- Orchestrator with router, responder, and synthesizer agents (LangChain create_agent)\n- Travel specialist (:8001) and Nutrition specialist (:8002) with Tavily research tools\n- Parallel fan-out: routes to multiple specialists concurrently, synthesizes combined response\n- Conversation continuity via LangGraph SQLite checkpointing (context_id as thread_id)\n- Cross-path memory: specialist responses injected into responder thread via aupdate_state\n- Kimi-style streaming UI with activity trail, markdown rendering, specialist badges\n- Threaded conversations with localStorage persistence\n- Specialist management modal (register/refresh from UI)\n- A2A protocol: agent cards, JSON-RPC, SSE streaming\n- Docker Compose: 4 services (orchestrator, travel, nutrition, frontend)","tree":{"sha":"cfe5397022a25a809e20e6a0b2557fb55ad8c3ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/git/trees/cfe5397022a25a809e20e6a0b2557fb55ad8c3ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chandra447/nimbus-chat/git/commits/3a9f9239f1e794779ef6d167064b39b5e3988a23","verification":{"p