e nested extraction, index-aware\ntransformation, map vs switchMap confusion pitfall.\nrxjs-mental-models: 10 conceptual frameworks (lazy function, conveyor belt,\ntime dimension, hot/cold, flattening as nested loops, scan as bank balance,\ncombineLatest as spreadsheet, error short-circuit, Subject as EventEmitter,\ntakeUntil as lifetime boundary), five diagnostic questions, five common\nconceptual errors corrected.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9d45861331c8df1d0de561297caa94b5e22a0782","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/git/trees/9d45861331c8df1d0de561297caa94b5e22a0782"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/git/commits/e0a89503f2abbd7e12ea7851aaf3aece89d6d997","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19405175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hansschenker","id":19405175,"login":"hansschenker","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDA1MTc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/commit/e0a89503f2abbd7e12ea7851aaf3aece89d6d997","node_id":"C_kwDOS-NZ9toAKGUwYTg5NTAzZjJhYmJkN2UxMmVhNzg1MWFhZjNhZWNlODlkNmQ5OTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/commit/c9c3678e8637c87571fb99ddf5472ebb1c68b2a1","sha":"c9c3678e8637c87571fb99ddf5472ebb1c68b2a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/commits/c9c3678e8637c87571fb99ddf5472ebb1c68b2a1"}],"sha":"e0a89503f2abbd7e12ea7851aaf3aece89d6d997","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/commits/e0a89503f2abbd7e12ea7851aaf3aece89d6d997"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19405175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hansschenker","id":19405175,"login":"hansschenker","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDA1MTc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/commits/c9c3678e8637c87571fb99ddf5472ebb1c68b2a1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T14:45:33Z","email":"gian.schenker@gmail.com","name":"Hans"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T14:45:33Z","email":"gian.schenker@gmail.com","name":"Hans"},"message":"add interval-timer-advanced, throttleTime-advanced, rxjs-svelte-patterns\n\ninterval/timer: timer vs interval initial-delay distinction, heartbeat/\nkeep-alive, session timeout with activity reset, countdown, staggered\ncascading starts, TTL cache, coordinated multi-timer, timer vs setTimeout\ncomparison table, interval vs timer(0,period) pitfall.\nthrottleTime: leading/trailing config with marble diagrams, button click\nrate limiting, scroll 60fps sampling, resize with trailing:true, typing\nindicator, mouse tracking, API rate limiting, decision table vs debounce\nvs auditTime, trailing-value-lost pitfall.\nrxjs-svelte-patterns: Svelte 5 runes integration, fromObservable helper,\nSvelte 4 store protocol compatibility (no adapter needed), bidirectional\nbridge utilities, search pipeline, shared service, WebSocket, polling with\npause/resume, Svelte store vs RxJS decision table.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b6cc84e30dbac2b47ff6f14d564db289e642c117","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/git/trees/b6cc84e30dbac2b47ff6f14d564db289e642c117"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/git/commits/c9c3678e8637c87571fb99ddf5472ebb1c68b2a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19405175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hansschenker","id":19405175,"login":"hansschenker","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDA1MTc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/commit/c9c3678e8637c87571fb99ddf5472ebb1c68b2a1","node_id":"C_kwDOS-NZ9toAKGM5YzM2NzhlODYzN2M4NzU3MWZiOTlkZGY1NDcyZWJiMWM2OGIyYTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/commit/f3e379faeb08c6a383a97aad9d480d156e8b2430","sha":"f3e379faeb08c6a383a97aad9d480d156e8b2430","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/commits/f3e379faeb08c6a383a97aad9d480d156e8b2430"}],"sha":"c9c3678e8637c87571fb99ddf5472ebb1c68b2a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/commits/c9c3678e8637c87571fb99ddf5472ebb1c68b2a1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19405175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hansschenker","id":19405175,"login":"hansschenker","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDA1MTc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/commits/f3e379faeb08c6a383a97aad9d480d156e8b2430/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T14:42:33Z","email":"gian.schenker@gmail.com","name":"Hans"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T14:42:33Z","email":"gian.schenker@gmail.com","name":"Hans"},"message":"add reduce-advanced, operator-selection-guide, rxjs-vue-patterns\n\nreduce: multi-metric aggregation in one pass, grouping/histogram with Map,\nlookup map building, validation accumulator, audit log summarizer,\ngroupBy+reduce reporting pipeline, ETL pattern, reduce vs toArray vs last,\ninfinite Observable pitfall, accumulator mutation pitfall.\noperator-selection-guide: decision tables for transform/filter/timing/\ncombination/error/buffering/creation/multicasting, Angular quick-ref,\nseven common recipe pipelines (search, auto-save, polling, loading state,\nform submit, WebSocket, view model).\nrxjs-vue-patterns: useObservable/useObservableState/useSearch composables,\nsingleton shared service with shareReplay, Pinia+RxJS store pattern,\nreactive route params, WebSocket composable, Vue watch<->RxJS bridging,\nSubject-per-instance pitfall.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aa1b0b150b72b5d0dd48634b93d07cd03edca05b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/git/trees/aa1b0b150b72b5d0dd48634b93d07cd03edca05b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/git/commits/f3e379faeb08c6a383a97aad9d480d156e8b2430","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19405175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanssch