events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/commits/e96243ffe35e00e7e2a635e6bfa145673fefb49c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T14:39:23Z","email":"gian.schenker@gmail.com","name":"Hans"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T14:39:23Z","email":"gian.schenker@gmail.com","name":"Hans"},"message":"add windowTime-advanced, defer-advanced, concurrency-guide\n\nwindowTime: bufferTime vs windowTime distinction, overlapping sliding\nwindows, session detection via bufferWhen+debounceTime, events-per-second\nrate monitoring, statistical aggregates (min/max/avg/count) per window,\nlog anomaly detection, windowTime vs bufferTime vs throttle decision table.\ndefer: stale closure prevention, retry-with-fresh-token pattern, lazy HTTP\nrequests, stateful factories (independent state per subscriber), conditional\nselection at subscribe time, resource cleanup with using(), defer vs of/from.\nconcurrency-guide: four concurrency models (unbounded/bounded/serial/drop),\nmergeMap(fn, N) request pool, dynamic concurrency, priority queue, fan-out\nfan-in, semaphore across streams, concurrency decision table.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cb7f67dd0545765113d065f4b68e560414b6624c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/git/trees/cb7f67dd0545765113d065f4b68e560414b6624c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/git/commits/e96243ffe35e00e7e2a635e6bfa145673fefb49c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"un