nker@gmail.com","name":"Hans"},"message":"add forkJoin-advanced, repeat-advanced, typescript-rxjs-guide\n\nThree new docs: forkJoin partial-failure patterns with safe<T> wrapper\nand initialization gate, repeat polling/reconnect/conditional patterns\nwith repeat vs retry comparison, and a TypeScript RxJS guide covering\ntype predicates in filter, generic operators, combineLatest tuple typing,\nand scan accumulator inference.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"820683344b10244440ed2911609008cbc196ec1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/git/trees/820683344b10244440ed2911609008cbc196ec1f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/git/commits/90ae02e30749a8bd88ccb3dec252305fea296741","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19405175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hansschenker","id":19405175,"login":"hansschenker","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDA1MTc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/commit/90ae02e30749a8bd88ccb3dec252305fea296741","node_id":"C_kwDOS-NZ9toAKDkwYWUwMmUzMDc0OWE4YmQ4OGNjYjNkZWMyNTIzMDVmZWEyOTY3NDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/commit/c6d26e8a203119cb0c2a9d48fb2c5170fa906f79","sha":"c6d26e8a203119cb0c2a9d48fb2c5170fa906f79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/commits/c6d26e8a203119cb0c2a9d48fb2c5170fa906f79"}],"sha":"90ae02e30749a8bd88ccb3dec252305fea296741","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/commits/90ae02e30749a8bd88ccb3dec252305fea296741"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19405175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hansschenker","id":19405175,"login":"hansschenker","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDA1MTc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/commits/c6d26e8a203119cb0c2a9d48fb2c5170fa906f79/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T14:08:44Z","email":"gian.schenker@gmail.com","name":"Hans"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T14:08:44Z","email":"gian.schenker@gmail.com","name":"Hans"},"message":"add withLatestFrom advanced, scan advanced, Angular Signals interop guide\n\n- withLatestFrom-advanced: subscription timing silent-drop problem; startWith\n  fix; vs combineLatestWith decision table; Angular route guard pattern; cold\n  other$ pitfall with shareReplay fix\n- scan-advanced: FSM with transition table, ring buffer, undo/redo history,\n  moving average, deduplicated event log; mutation-of-accumulator pitfall\n- angular-signals-rxjs: toSignal/toObservable reference; initialValue and\n  requireSync options; signal+Observable combining; effect() vs toObservable;\n  async pipe migration; toObservable sync-emit debounce pitfall\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ba4a3754dfe1dea9d18e06f29edee6fe903d80d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/git/trees/ba4a3754dfe1dea9d18e06f29edee6fe903d80d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/git/commits/c6d26e8a203119cb0c2a9d48fb2c5170fa906f79","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19405175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hansschenker","id":19405175,"login":"hansschenker","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDA1MTc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/commit/c6d26e8a203119cb0c2a9d48fb2c5170fa906f79","node_id":"C_kwDOS-NZ9toAKGM2ZDI2ZThhMjAzMTE5Y2IwYzJhOWQ0OGZiMmM1MTcwZmE5MDZmNzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/commit/601bf1e6375939fad7018d6168e3e8a57d5f1593","sha":"601bf1e6375939fad7018d6168e3e8a57d5f1593","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/commits/601bf1e6375939fad7018d6168e3e8a57d5f1593"}],"sha":"c6d26e8a203119cb0c2a9d48fb2c5170fa906f79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/commits/c6d26e8a203119cb0c2a9d48fb2c5170fa906f79"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19405175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hansschenker","id":19405175,"login":"hansschenker","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDA1MTc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/commits/601bf1e6375939fad7018d6168e3e8a57d5f1593/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T14:05:59Z","email":"gian.schenker@gmail.com","name":"Hans"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T14:05:59Z","email":"gian.schenker@gmail.com","name":"Hans"},"message":"add mergeMap advanced, expand advanced, RxJS best practices guide\n\n- mergeMap-advanced: concurrent parameter guide, request deduplication with\n  in-flight cache, fan-out/fan-in, per-item retry, streaming aggregation,\n  backpressure via concurrency limit; unlimited concurrency pitfall\n- expand-advanced: cursor/HATEOAS pagination, BFS vs DFS traversal, file\n  system walk, graph walking with cycle detection, queueScheduler for deep\n  recursion; missing EMPTY terminator pitfall\n- rxjs-best-practices: consolidated code review checklist — 11 rule categories\n  covering subscriptions, cold/hot, flattening selection, errors, performance,\n  TypeScript, custom operators, anti-pattern table\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"980cfbf7d7202d3a5739a6840b72c02398f1c05a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/git/trees/980cfbf7d7202d3a5739a6840b72c02398f1c05a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/git/commits/601bf1e6375939fad7018d6168e3e8a57d5f1593","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19405175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hansschenker","id":19405175,"login":"hansschenker","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDA1MTc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/received_events","repos_u