itter":{"date":"2026-06-18T12:12:13Z","email":"gian.schenker@gmail.com","name":"Hans"},"message":"document ReplaySubject and defer operators\n\n- ReplaySubject (subject) — buffered multicast; covers bufferSize/windowTime params, ReplaySubject(1) vs BehaviorSubject distinction, Infinity buffer memory leak anti-pattern\n- defer (creation) — lazy Observable factory; covers eager vs lazy evaluation, conditional Observable selection, fresh-token retry pattern, and defer vs shareReplay contrast\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7d20409e28affb0845e95fc152243ca6c79eb3dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/git/trees/7d20409e28affb0845e95fc152243ca6c79eb3dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/git/commits/bb4aba579f39d0290531ac5c57a0f39d5c6b628c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19405175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hansschenker","id":19405175,"login":"hansschenker","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDA1MTc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/commit/bb4aba579f39d0290531ac5c57a0f39d5c6b628c","node_id":"C_kwDOS-NZ9toAKGJiNGFiYTU3OWYzOWQwMjkwNTMxYWM1YzU3YTBmMzlkNWM2YjYyOGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/commit/a37db80af5356c7ea05cddaf3b4ced2f45e465e8","sha":"a37db80af5356c7ea05cddaf3b4ced2f45e465e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/commits/a37db80af5356c7ea05cddaf3b4ced2f45e465e8"}],"sha":"bb4aba579f39d0290531ac5c57a0f39d5c6b628c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/commits/bb4aba579f39d0290531ac5c57a0f39d5c6b628c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19405175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hansschenker","id":19405175,"login":"hansschenker","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDA1MTc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/commits/a37db80af5356c7ea05cddaf3b4ced2f45e465e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T12:09:48Z","email":"gian.schenker@gmail.com","name":"Hans"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T12:09:48Z","email":"gian.schenker@gmail.com","name":"Hans"},"message":"document of, Subject, and finalize operators\n\nThree new entries under the eight-policy framework:\n- of (creation) — synchronous static emitter; covers of([arr]) vs from([arr]) distinction, synchronous ordering proof, and Promise-wrapping anti-pattern\n- Subject (subject) — multicast bridge; covers no-replay semantics, destroy$ pattern, action dispatcher pattern, and the three anti-patterns (state container, complete() reuse, public exposure)\n- finalize (utility) — universal teardown hook; covers the three termination paths table, why tap({ complete }) misses unsubscription, switchMap per-request spinner cleanup, and finalize placement relative to retry\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d56da20daeb1f4f558f8000d133b3dbfb0cb4399","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/git/trees/d56da20daeb1f4f558f8000d133b3dbfb0cb4399"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansschenker/rxjs-operators-documentation/git/commits/a37db80af5356c7ea05cddaf3b4ced2f45e465e8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19405175?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hansschenker","id":19405175,"login":"hansschenker","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDA1MTc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansschenker/starred{/owner}{/