026-08-18T18:26:50Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T18:26:50Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"message":"Add app-wide smooth data-reveal animation; use it for resource filters\n\nNew global utility (both apps): `data-reveal` fades a block in, and\n`data-reveal-stagger` cascades a grid/list/table''s rows in — so data appears with\na smooth animation instead of a hard flicker. Re-keying an element on a filter\nchange replays it. Wired into the resources card grid + list, keyed by the type\nfilter, so switching All/Videos/Articles animates the new results in. Reusable on\nany list across the app; respects prefers-reduced-motion.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4b69e9d7fa5e6760bac1ba65be821e3146c8ec97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/trees/4b69e9d7fa5e6760bac1ba65be821e3146c8ec97"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/commits/db555715f9011077829320b0824a3b22ad38ce66","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscription