090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/52c48a7d20492cd443e1f6a160209f717a7455eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T18:05:07Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T18:05:07Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"message":"Resources: beautiful in-app article reader with heading navigation\n\nReplace the framed server page with a proper reading experience:\n- A persistent \"On this page\" contents nav listing every heading and subheading\n  (indented by level). Click one to smoothly scroll the article to that exact\n  heading; a scroll-spy highlights whichever heading you''re currently reading.\n- A comfortable centred reading column (measured line length, larger type,\n  generous rhythm, ruled h2s) that fills the modal instead of a narrow page\n  floating in grey gutters.\n- Responsive: on narrow screens the contents nav becomes a slide-over drawer.\n- Still bulletproof — raw-markdown fallback via the error boundary, plus download\n  and \"Open ↗\" to the standalone page.\n\nNow safe to render in-app (react-markdown): the earlier \"markdown not showing\"\nwas the organization=null bug, since fixed — not a rendering problem.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2c5817c764f4297031f074cbb3ad95bd38cdffd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/trees/2c5817c764f4297031f074cbb3ad95bd38cdffd1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/commits/52c48a7d20492cd443e1f6a160209f717a7455eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commit/52c48a7d20492cd443e1f6a160209f717a7455eb","node_id":"C_kwDOS-UOsNoAKDUyYzQ4YTdkMjA0OTJjZDQ0M2UxZjZhMTYwMjA5ZjcxN2E3NDU1ZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commit/82b64fccb23615a84c58d42e502be64994eb74dd","sha":"82b64fccb23615a84c58d42e502be64994eb74dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/82b64fccb23615a84c58d42e502be64994eb74dd"}],"sha":"52c48a7d20492cd443e1f6a160209f717a7455eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/52c48a7d20492cd443e1f6a160209f717a7455eb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/82b64fccb23615a84c58d42e502be64994eb74dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T17:58:21Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T17:58:21Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"message":"Fix article view \"Resource not found\" via file-token auth\n\nauthenticateFile set only req.auth.userId. Now that asyncHandler re-enters the\ntenant context from req.auth, a missing organization made the tenant plugin DENY\nthe Resource.findById in viewResource → \"Resource not found\" for every article\n(videos/images were unaffected — they read GridFS, which isn''t org-scoped).\n\nCarry role + organization in req.auth so org-scoped lookups in file-token routes\nresolve in the caller''s tenant. All 107 backend tests pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"10b8f6a087a726673bf716a860bfd84a6cb7fdbd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/trees/10b8f6a087a726673bf716a860bfd84a6cb7fdbd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/commits/82b64fccb23615a84c58d42e502be64994eb74dd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commit/82b64fccb23615a84c58d42e502be64994eb74dd","node_id":"C_kwDOS-UOsNoAKDgyYjY0ZmNjYjIzNjE1YTg0YzU4ZDQyZTUwMmJlNjQ5OTRlYjc0ZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commit/63edcd5c2c752a45fe831443169c0f1ae71ac593","sha":"63edcd5c2c752a45fe831443169c0f1ae71ac593","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/63edcd5c2c752a45fe831443169c0f1ae71ac593"}],"sha":"82b64fccb23615a84c58d42e502be64994eb74dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/82b64fccb23615a84c58d42e502be64994eb74dd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/63edcd5c2c752a45fe831443169c0f1ae71ac593/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T17:53:04Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T17:53:04Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"message":"Fix uploads saving with organization=null (context lost across multer)\n\nauthenticate runs each request inside the tenant AsyncLocalStorage store, but a\nmultipart upload streams the file through the MongoDB connection pool, which can\nsever the ALS chain. By the time the upload handler ran, currentTenant() was\nsometimes null, so the new resource/file was stamped organization:null and then\ndisappeared from the org-scoped list — this is why only some videos/articles\nshowed up (\"only 4 videos\", \"markdown not displaying\").\n\nasyncHandler now re-establishes the tenant context from req.auth (a plain request\nproperty, immune to the ALS break) before running the handler. For non-upload\nroutes the context is already correct, so it''s a harmless no-op; for uploads it\nrestores the right org scope. Fixes every multipart route (resources, certificates,\nprofiles, announcements, projects, etc.) at once. All 107 backend tests pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"08e608a8d96bc5e68024b511e5858d83e1650a9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/trees/08e608a8d96bc5e68024b511e5858d83e1650a9f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/commits/63edcd5c2c752a45fe831443169c0f1ae71ac593","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commit/63edcd5c2c752a45fe831443169c0f1ae71ac593","node_id":"C_kwDOS-UOsNoAKDYzZWRjZDVjMmM3NTJhNDVmZTgzMTQ0MzE2OWMwZjFhZTcxYWM1OTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commit/850728272a470cea5af5de63a68ac886f5d92ebd","sha":"850728272a470cea5af5de63a68ac886f5d92ebd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/850728272a470cea5af5de63a68ac886f5d92ebd"}],"sha":"63edcd5c2c752a45fe831443169c0f1ae71ac593","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/63edcd5c2c752a45fe831443169c0f1ae71ac593"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/850728272a470cea5af5de63a68ac886f5d92ebd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T17:45:34Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T17:45:34Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"message":"Resources: allow large video uploads + cleaner back button\n\n- Raise the resource upload limit from 100 MB to 500 MB. Lecture videos\n  routinely exceed 100 MB, so multer rejected them with LIMIT_FILE_SIZE while\n  small images went through — that''s why \"only images were being added\". The\n  file picker now hints the accepted formats and 500 MB ceiling, and filters to\n  video/* when adding a video.\n- Redesign the \"All resources\" back control as a simple rounded chip above the\n  page title (with hover + press feedback) instead of faint subtitle text.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ddc081ab4c722a592956def9ab7f75599fde7f33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/trees/ddc081ab4c722a592956def9ab7f75599fd