https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/baba35ab7b2e581bd6b8c05ea806c56572517ecd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T17:28:05Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T17:28:05Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"message":"Resources: dedicated section (module → topic → resource) in both apps\n\nNew \"Resources\" sidebar tab (students, trainers, admins — not super-admin):\n- Landing page: a card per accessible module.\n- Module page: resources grouped by topic, with a type filter (All / Videos /\n  Articles / Links) and a card/list view toggle.\n- Videos play in-app (native controls for uploaded/direct files; YouTube/Vimeo\n  embed). Articles open an in-app reading space with rendered markdown + a\n  headings outline (react-markdown, bulletproof reader) and an \"open in new tab\"\n  to the server-rendered page. Links open out.\n- Admins/assigned trainers add/edit/delete (topic picker in the add form);\n  students view (still gated to topics marked taught). Uses the existing\n  resource endpoints/permissions — no backend change.\n\nRemoved the old per-topic resources UI from the module detail''s SyllabusBoard\n(and deleted TopicResources in both apps); module detail now covers syllabus/\nconcepts only, and all resource management lives in the Resources section.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"edbd8888a4d89784cbe3efce4f6450e051acabe6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/trees/edbd8888a4d89784cbe3efce4f6450e051acabe6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/commits/baba35ab7b2e581bd6b8c05ea806c56572517ecd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commit/baba35ab7b2e581bd6b8c05ea806c56572517ecd","node_id":"C_kwDOS-UOsNoAKGJhYmEzNWFiN2IyZTU4MWJkNmI4YzA1ZWE4MDZjNTY1NzI1MTdlY2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commit/9a94535e64aff3ad7edb2a915a3d17d9378e6f73","sha":"9a94535e64aff3ad7edb2a915a3d17d9378e6f73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/9a94535e64aff3ad7edb2a915a3d17d9378e6f73"}],"sha":"baba35ab7b2e581bd6b8c05ea806c56572517ecd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/baba35ab7b2e581bd6b8c05ea806c56572517ecd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/9a94535e64aff3ad7edb2a915a3d17d9378e6f73/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T17:06:43Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T17:06:43Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"message":"Modules: readable /modules/<CODE> URLs instead of the raw ObjectId\n\nModule pages now open at /app/modules/LLMFOUND rather than\n/app/modules/<24-char id>. The module GET resolves the param as either an\nObjectId or a code (codes are uppercase + unique per org, tenant-scoped), so it\nstays backward-compatible with any existing id links. Navigation from the\nmodule lists (both apps) and the student curriculum now uses the code.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"366baa9957c066b3075673f22b9b42f4b9566c85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/trees/366baa9957c066b3075673f22b9b42f4b9566c85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/commits/9a94535e64aff3ad7edb2a915a3d17d9378e6f73","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commit/9a94535e64aff3ad7edb2a915a3d17d9378e6f73","node_id":"C_kwDOS-UOsNoAKDlhOTQ1MzVlNjRhZmYzYWQ3ZWRiMmE5MTVhM2QxN2Q5Mzc4ZTZmNzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commit/08c669c0d83596de984f743b65da43f2b201a5dd","sha":"08c669c0d83596de984f743b65da43f2b201a5dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/08c669c0d83596de984f743b65da43f2b201a5dd"}],"sha":"9a94535e64aff3ad7edb2a915a3d17d9378e6f73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/9a94535e64aff3ad7edb2a915a3d17d9378e6f73"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/08c669c0d83596de984f743b65da43f2b201a5dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T12:30:06Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T12:30:06Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"message":"Articles: open as a server-rendered page in a new tab\n\nSwitch article display away from the in-app modal renderer to a standalone,\nserver-rendered HTML page opened in a new tab — the same reliable path videos\nand links use (a plain link), immune to client-render/cache issues.\n\n- New GET /api/resources/:id/view renders the article''s markdown to a styled\n  HTML page with markdown-it (GFM tables/code/lists; html:false so raw HTML is\n  escaped; locked-down CSP with no scripts). File-token (?t=) authed so a\n  new-tab navigation works, like the uploads route.\n- Article titles are now links (articleViewUrl) in both apps; removed the\n  in-app ArticleReader modal from the resource list.\n- Non-article resources with a url redirect to it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"95eb7607599fc8e4558dfb7b37cec8a56ab24d3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/trees/95eb7607599fc8e4558dfb7b37cec8a56ab24d3d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/commits/08c669c0d83596de984f743b65da43f2b201a5dd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commit/08c669c0d83596de984f743b65da43f2b201a5dd","node_id":"C_kwDOS-UOsNoAKDA4YzY2OWMwZDgzNTk2ZGU5ODRmNzQzYjY1ZGE0M2YyYjIwMWE1ZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commit/e02fa7d0a7dbb44437ad3a95f28859d782961111","sha":"e02fa7d0a7dbb44437ad3a95f28859d782961111","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/e02fa7d0a7dbb44437ad3a95f28859d782961111"}],"sha":"08c669c0d83596de984f743b65da43f2b201a5dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/08c669c0d83596de984f743b65da43f2b201a5dd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/e02fa7d0a7dbb44437ad3a95f28859d782961111/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T12:15:22Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T12:15:22Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"message":"API: Cache-Control no-store on JSON — fixes stale/empty resource lists\n\nThe API sent no Cache-Control, so browsers applied heuristic caching and could\nserve a stale list — e.g. the resources list from before an article/link was\nadded — making freshly-added items appear to never upload/show. Send\nCache-Control: no-store on all /api responses (file downloads still set their\nown cache headers in-handler). Combined with the earlier ETag removal, every\nAPI read is now guaranteed fresh.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2964a9a836c27d9d520dbbc2139ecdeb11622d79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/trees/2964a9a836c27d9d520dbbc2139ecdeb11622d79"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/commits/e02fa7d0a7dbb44437ad3a95f28859d782961111","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commit/e02fa7d0a7dbb44437ad3a95f28859d782961111","node_id":"C_kwDOS-UOsNoAKGUwMmZhN2QwYTdkYmI0NDQzN2FkM2E5NWYyODg1OWQ3ODI5NjExMTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commit/8b9573845f1b021540af10c4e2fa1c2c72048239","sha":"8b9573845f1b021540af10c4e2fa1c2c72048239","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/8b9573845f1b021540af10c4e2fa1c2c72048239"}],"sha":"e02fa7d0a7dbb44437ad3a95f28859d782961111","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/e02fa7d0a7dbb44437ad3a95f28859d782961111"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/8b9573845f1b021540af10c4e2fa1c2c72048239/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T12:02:15Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T12:02:15Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"message":"Articles: bulletproof reader — never blank, raw fallback + download\n\nWrap the markdown render in an error boundary that falls back to the raw\nmarkdown text, add a \"download .md\" button, and show a clear message for empty\ncontent — so an article is always visible even if rendering ever fails. Both apps.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f7f6220ff2454774ceed551e653ca57c1293353","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/trees/0f7f6220ff2454774ceed551e653ca57c1293353"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/