tps://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/12c6ae26482271b1fac59afd437228d68baaf348/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T11:37:03Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T11:37:03Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"message":"API: disable ETag so responses are always fresh 200s (no 304s)\n\nThe API is dynamic, per-user and authenticated, so conditional GETs (304 Not\nModified) offer no real caching benefit and cause confusion when debugging\n\"why isn''t my new data showing\". Disable ETag app-wide so every request returns\nthe current body with a 200.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bf72a6ed2d9401cc7e28068715f8f3414a82c7a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/trees/bf72a6ed2d9401cc7e28068715f8f3414a82c7a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/commits/12c6ae26482271b1fac59afd437228d68baaf348","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commit/12c6ae26482271b1fac59afd437228d68baaf348","node_id":"C_kwDOS-UOsNoAKDEyYzZhZTI2NDgyMjcxYjFmYWM1OWFmZDQzNzIyOGQ2OGJhYWYzNDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commit/f8be7e754e6dd406201fe4e887691a97198db472","sha":"f8be7e754e6dd406201fe4e887691a97198db472","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/f8be7e754e6dd406201fe4e887691a97198db472"}],"sha":"12c6ae26482271b1fac59afd437228d68baaf348","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/12c6ae26482271b1fac59afd437228d68baaf348"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/f8be7e754e6dd406201fe4e887691a97198db472/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T11:01:20Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T11:01:20Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"message":"Articles: full GitHub-Flavored Markdown rendering\n\nReplace the limited in-house markdown parser with react-markdown + remark-gfm,\nso uploaded .md articles render faithfully: tables, images, task lists,\nstrikethrough, autolinks, nested lists and fenced code — not just the old\nheading/bold/list/quote subset (which made real docs look blank). Raw HTML is\nstill not rendered and URLs are sanitised, so it stays XSS-safe. rehype-slug\nadds heading ids and tocFromMarkdown now uses github-slugger so the article\ncontents-nav jump-links keep working. Added GFM table/image/checkbox styles.\nApplied to both apps (student/trainer + admin).\n\nThe markdown unit test now covers the contents outline (node env, to sidestep\nthe repo''s pre-existing jsdom/@exodus-bytes worker issue).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"05f4a6847251c4b38dc98bad817ef17d27031fd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/trees/05f4a6847251c4b38dc98bad817ef17d27031fd9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/commits/f8be7e754e6dd406201fe4e887691a97198db472","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","