5d5890b76c0c050f80c44f7986b76aa13cb80/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T05:23:56Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T05:23:56Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"message":"P3 audit polish: role gates, a11y, consistency touches\n\n- Role-gate the student/trainer routes: typing a wrong-role URL (e.g. a student\n  opening /app/analytics) now redirects instead of dead-ending on a 403 page.\n- Both apps: /login redirects to /app when already signed in.\n- Project screenshot links now carry the file-access token (were opening blank).\n- Clickable project cards are keyboard-operable (role=button, tabIndex, Enter/Space).\n- Approvals sidebar badge now counts pending tech-tag requests too.\n- Trainer module cards show \"N syllabus sections\" instead of a dead 0/N\n  completion bar (trainers never set topic.completed).\n- Question-bank import help no longer advertises an \"optional points\" column\n  that import ignores (points come from complexity).\n- Admin Modal gains the closeOnOverlayClick opt-out (parity with the frontend).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a420a394e44f5d544ddd926ea6f4b32f25464a81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/trees/a420a394e44f5d544ddd926ea6f4b32f25464a81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/commits/abb5d5890b76c0c050f80c44f7986b76aa13cb80","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","htm