o}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/a5e6108f9e3720bb4033247e83768e5aa58ac1a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T04:58:11Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T04:58:11Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"message":"P2 #7: password recovery for the admin portal\n\nThe admin/super-admin login had no self-service recovery — a forgotten password\nwas an unrecoverable lockout. Adds a \"Forgot password?\" flow (email one-time\ncode → verify → set new password) reusing the existing role-agnostic\n/auth/request-otp, /verify-otp and /set-password endpoints (ONBOARDABLE =\nACTIVE, so active admins qualify). New LMS_Admin/src/lib/account.js mirrors the\nstudent app''s helpers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1e357c0e2c76b46fd553d68f0a98a5aef4231a70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/trees/1e357c0e2c76b46fd553d68f0a98a5aef4231a70"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/commits/a5e6108f9e3720bb4033247e83768e5aa58ac1a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/A