w_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/084cdc8b00cb6196cd31049be86d56ac349ce1d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T04:56:01Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T04:56:01Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"message":"P2 audit fixes: session hygiene, confirms, notification read model\n\n- #6: Student/trainer logout now clears the React Query cache (like admin), so\n  the next user on a shared device never sees the previous user''s data flash.\n- #8: The proctored exam Submit buttons now confirm first (flagging any\n  unanswered questions); the auto-submit paths (timeout / violation cap) stay\n  immediate.\n- #9: Destructive clicks now confirm — delete certificate template, remove a\n  student or module from a batch, remove a trainer from a module.\n- #10: Opening the notifications bell no longer marks everything read; that now\n  happens only when the full notifications list is opened.\n- #11: The trainer''s batch page explains when they see no modules because\n  they''re not mapped to any module in the batch (vs the batch having none).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c1cf14e18befd10597e891af0754540d641c3d4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/trees/c1cf14e18befd10597e891af0754540d641c3d4e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/commits/084cdc8b00cb6196cd31049be86d56ac349ce1d5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"