se,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/03c395332063f18363d9f778d14c6c828c4ebc4b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T15:03:16Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T15:03:16Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"message":"P1 #1 (trainer): submission review + regrade / manual grade / reattempt\n\nTrainers now get the same grading tools admins have: each row in the\nSubmissions table opens a Review drill-in showing the student''s answers vs the\ncorrect answers, with actions to re-run AI grading, set the score manually, or\ngrant a reattempt (wiring the previously-dead useGrantReattempt plus new\nregrade/manual-grade hooks). The consolidated submissions payload now includes\neach attempt''s answers so the drill-in can render them.\n\nCloses the trainer half of the grading gap (the admin half shipped in 67d924b).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b84a0b747b05b881da9a5fc5f90c064f11b77f23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/trees/b84a0b747b05b881da9a5fc5f90c064f11b77f23"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/commits/03c395332063f18363d9f778d14c6c828c4ebc4b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://a