"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/67d924bbc768771a47cb877832cc7f60ccd544c9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T14:53:05Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T14:53:05Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"message":"P1 audit fixes: grading drill-in, settings scope, dashboard join, un-suspend\n\n- #1 (grading, admin): submissions now have a Review drill-in showing the\n  student''s answers vs the correct answers, plus actions to re-run AI grading,\n  set the score manually (new backend override endpoint), or grant a reattempt.\n  Closes the \"AI mis-scored / stuck Evaluating and I can''t fix it\" hole.\n- #2 (super-admin settings): a managing super-admin now edits the GLOBAL\n  settings doc, not the master-template org — /settings is only org-scoped when\n  actually drilled into a real org.\n- #4 (student dashboard): \"Join\" now routes in-app (LiveKit) classes to the\n  live room and renders a Join button for internal classes (no meetingLink).\n- #5 (org detail): editing an org no longer silently re-activates a suspended\n  one — the form seeds status/name from the loaded org.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4a4890df44221a25e68e7eae1c73c79ab8870e09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/trees/4a4890df44221a25e68e7eae1c73c79ab8870e09"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/commits/67d924bbc768771a47cb877832cc7f60ccd544c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commit/67d924bbc768771a47cb877832cc7f60ccd544c9","node_id":"C_kwDOS-UOsNoAKDY3ZDkyNGJiYzc2ODc3MWE0N2NiODc3ODMyY2M3ZjYwY2NkNTQ0Yzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commit/65e3b4d19d0aa6a5c99706dd569d7bc60b392f33","sha":"65e3b4d19d0aa6a5c99706dd569d7bc60b392f33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/65e3b4d19d0aa6a5c99706dd569d7bc60b392f33"}],"sha":"67d924bbc768771a47cb877832cc7f60ccd544c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/67d924bbc768771a47cb877832cc7f60ccd544c9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/65e3b4d19d0aa6a5c99706dd569d7bc60b392f33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T11:38:12Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T11:38:12Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"message":"Auth hardening (#12) + student-visible trainer contact (#4)\n\n- JWT secrets no longer fall back to a hardcoded value. Production throws if\n  JWT_ACCESS_SECRET / JWT_REFRESH_SECRET are missing (previously a non-empty\n  \"dev-*\" fallback meant prod would silently run with a guessable secret);\n  dev/test mint an ephemeral random secret per boot instead.\n- jwt.verify is pinned to HS256 (algorithms: [''HS256'']) on every verify path\n  (access, refresh, file, reset) to block alg:none / algorithm-confusion.\n- Module \"Assigned Trainers\" panel: trainer email is now a mailto: link.\n  Students already receive the assigned-trainers list via GET /modules/:id, so\n  no new endpoint was needed — this just makes the contact clickable.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"243f307b51ff5c1ec8096dd580dceeb262e9208a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/trees/243f307b51ff5c1ec8096dd580dceeb262e9208a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/commit