onger fire PATCH on\n  empty/unchanged input — a no-op guard shows \"No changes to save.\" instead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"29943cba0d2ca1a2371a498465981bd120fc2571","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/trees/29943cba0d2ca1a2371a498465981bd120fc2571"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/commits/d7faa4929807ac64fb20d0c55c1cc0282aca2461","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commit/d7faa4929807ac64fb20d0c55c1cc0282aca2461","node_id":"C_kwDOS-UOsNoAKGQ3ZmFhNDkyOTgwN2FjNjRmYjIwZDBjNTVjMWNjMDI4MmFjYTI0NjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commit/d08cace1fa574950ac3c92039a5b1023e422ae08","sha":"d08cace1fa574950ac3c92039a5b1023e422ae08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/d08cace1fa574950ac3c92039a5b1023e422ae08"}],"sha":"d7faa4929807ac64fb20d0c55c1cc0282aca2461","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/d7faa4929807ac64fb20d0c55c1cc0282aca2461"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/d08cace1fa574950ac3c92039a5b1023e422ae08/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T09:56:50Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T09:56:50Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"message":"Tier 1 tester-bug fixes: form-loss, syllabus overwrite, error messages\n\nFixes the highest-impact items from the tester bug sheet:\n\n- #5/#8: Add-Project and Ask-a-Doubt modals no longer discard the whole form\n  when clicking outside. Modal gains an opt-in closeOnOverlayClick prop\n  (default true, unchanged for other modals); these two set it false.\n- #14: Syllabus upload now shows a pre-import diff — each topic tagged New vs\n  \"Will overwrite\", a count summary, and a warning when existing topics'' concepts\n  will be replaced. No more silent overwrite discovered only after import.\n- #4: Student/trainer portal no longer fires the ADMIN-only /users call. The\n  module TrainersPanel query is gated to admins (assigned list still shows).\n- #6: External-certificate create surfaces the real field message instead of a\n  generic \"Validation failed\".\n- #7: Certificate add form clears its error when switching Paste-link/Upload-file.\n- #1/#11: Profile link fields (details, resume, project) validate URLs client-side\n  with a clear message instead of a server-side \"links.x: Enter a valid URL\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c5222377286eff8aba6c8cbfa8898ad35383e7a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/trees/c5222377286eff8aba6c8cbfa8898ad35383e7a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/commits/d08cace1fa574950ac3c92039a5b1023e422ae08","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","u