ainer feedback: trainers can see their own class feedback\n\nNew GET /feedback/me (trainer-only) returns the same summary + comments as the\nadmin view, minus the cross-trainer leaderboard. Adds a \"My Feedback\" page to\nthe trainer app (Insights nav): stat tiles, overall-rating distribution,\nparameter averages, improvement-area keywords, and the students'' written\ncomments — so a trainer sees exactly where they can improve.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"64aa528c544bb1fa0a17211c1c84f77e7b823715","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/trees/64aa528c544bb1fa0a17211c1c84f77e7b823715"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/commits/ce57feaf544c7475a8028287de0682682ddbd283","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commit/ce57feaf544c7475a8028287de0682682ddbd283","node_id":"C_kwDOS-UOsNoAKGNlNTdmZWFmN