w it shows just the answers: the student''s picked\noption — green when correct, red when wrong — and, only when they were wrong,\nthe correct option in green. Skipped questions read \"Not answered\". Text\nquestions show the student''s answer and the actual/model answer.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"453f266519358fb21c3d8cce0025c0bd4f049c54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/trees/453f266519358fb21c3d8cce0025c0bd4f049c54"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/commits/33ec00baf80c9530e80aac31872ca5a469e3aec2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commit/33ec00baf80c9530e80aac31872ca5a469e3aec2","node_id":"C_kwDOS-UOsNoAKDMzZWMwMGJhZjgwYzk1MzBlODBhYWMzMTg3MmNhNWE0NjllM2FlYzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commit/65d5667137de146422b200ea869c5819ae30ab5e","sha":"65d5667137de146422b200ea869c5819ae30ab5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/65d5667137de146422b200ea869c5819ae30ab5e"}],"sha":"33ec00baf80c9530e80aac31872ca5a469e3aec2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/33ec00baf80c9530e80aac31872ca5a469e3aec2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/65d5667137de146422b200ea869c5819ae30ab5e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T04:30:52Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T04:30:52Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"message":"Trainer feedback: per-parameter class ratings + admin dashboard\n\nStudents now rate each class on five parameters (subject knowledge, clarity,\nengagement, pace, doubt handling) plus a separate Overall rating. When Overall\nis below 5, an improvement section appears — multi-select keyword chips (low\npractical knowledge, needs improvement in lectures, communication/English,\npoor time management, not engaging) and a free-text comment.\n\nBackend: ClassRating gains parameters{} + keywords[]; the submit endpoint\naccepts and sanitises them. New /feedback overview (admin/super-admin) with a\nper-trainer leaderboard, scoped summary (avg overall, star distribution,\nparameter averages, keyword tallies) and recent written feedback.\n\nAdmin: new Feedback page with a trainer dropdown (All trainers or one), stat\ntiles, rating distribution + parameter-average charts, improvement-area chart,\ntrainer leaderboard, and a comments feed. Shared FEEDBACK_PARAMETERS/KEYWORDS\nconstants keep both apps in sync.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2fab6c013020abb326f9735135a9da12db6b4136","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/trees/2fab6c013020abb326f9735135a9da12db6b4136"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/commits/65d5667137de146422b200ea869c5819ae30ab5e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscripti