"email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"message":"Analytics: count a batch''s certificates by where they were earned\n\nbatchOverview counted certificates by the student''s CURRENT batch membership,\nso a student who moved batches carried their old certificate into the new\nbatch''s analytics — the analytics tile showed 1 for AIRE 2028 while the\ncertificates page (which filters by cert.batch) correctly showed 0.\n\nCount by cert.batch instead, so a certificate stays with the batch it was\nearned in and analytics matches the certificates page.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7ef7cefd702b1bd6f0c71c24b80740bccbc64aaa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/trees/7ef7cefd702b1bd6f0c71c24b80740bccbc64aaa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/commits/5a6092db5fdb778d4d49f953e88aae617c850eb6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"http