d{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commits/7a0dfe036aa42e67da951e39934c05e95a89aa96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T16:58:28Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T16:58:28Z","email":"22MH1A05J7@acoe.edu.in","name":"ABHISHEK-J7"},"message":"Auth: isolate admin/student sessions + don''t log out on transient refresh failures\n\nBoth SPAs share one origin (and one localStorage), so identical token keys let\none app clobber the other''s tokens → spurious logouts. Namespace the admin\napp''s keys (lms.admin.*); the student app keeps lms.*.\n\nAlso make the refresh resilient: only sign out on a genuine 401 (invalid/expired\nrefresh token). A network error or 5xx (backend restarting) is transient and now\nkeeps the session instead of bouncing the user to /login every few minutes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a359318e08a5ec6f6fa8d0a900afd527dfb1c8ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/trees/a359318e08a5ec6f6fa8d0a900afd527dfb1c8ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/commits/7a0dfe036aa42e67da951e39934c05e95a89aa96","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609