ronously during render (both apps) so charts that\n  resolve var() via getComputedStyle no longer paint one theme behind — the\n  org-status donut and new-students trend now show the correct per-theme colour\n  instead of the opposite theme''s.\n- Orange chart palette: replace the near-black secondary/pale accent series with\n  a curated high-visibility multi-hue palette so orange-theme charts (e.g.\n  questions per module) are readable. Green palette unchanged.\n- Team Composition donut uses the visible palette; Org Status \"Suspended\" slice\n  uses a fixed amber so it stays distinct from the primary in the orange theme.\n- Questions-per-module chart excludes project/certification modules (core\n  curriculum only).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6278e2ecbcc0c6870c00c86edbb129634557c8a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/trees/6278e2ecbcc0c6870c00c86edbb129634557c8a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/commits/a93447bfbbaa34fe966911b3b76d4053599ab584","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url