e photo'' button,\n  name + role badge, email/phone, bio, and clickable platform-link icons.\n- Students get gamified stat chips (Attendance / Modules / Certificates / Avg\n  score) and a curriculum-progress bar in the hero.\n- Body: a side column (Edit details + Platform links) and a main column\n  (Projects + Resume for students; Scoreboard for trainers). Responsive, theme-aware.\n\nFrontend builds.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0780c6be1137ab42d0df72091b292eff3ab00c96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/trees/0780c6be1137ab42d0df72091b292eff3ab00c96"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/git/commits/085324adddcc6a06e78be4e1f166f242b575bc35","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119723609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090","id":119723609,"login":"Abhi-5090","node_id":"U_kgDOByLWWQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhi-5090","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Abhi-5090/LMS_AI_Ready_Engineer/commit/085324adddcc6a06e78be4e1f166f242b575bc35","node_id":"C_kwDOS-UOsNoAKDA4NTMyNGFkZGRjYzZhMDZlNzhiZTRlMWYxNjZm