/trees/adfd13b1250eca0d38a8fc812a49f0d0f6d5463b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/git/commits/bcab8500fabe8f22e76fb9776328296604ca53b2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44068562?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Leikoe","id":44068562,"login":"Leikoe","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MDY4NTYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Leikoe/sanic/commit/bcab8500fabe8f22e76fb9776328296604ca53b2","node_id":"C_kwDOTBf03doAKGJjYWI4NTAwZmFiZThmMjJlNzZmYjk3NzYzMjgyOTY2MDRjYTUzYjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Leikoe/sanic/commit/9067f09c0e3db4668945108248fa26304067c720","sha":"9067f09c0e3db4668945108248fa26304067c720","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/commits/9067f09c0e3db4668945108248fa26304067c720"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Leikoe/sanic/commit/08ef12e50257706a771fcebaecb893c22dd40978","sha":"08ef12e50257706a771fcebaecb893c22dd40978","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/commits/08ef12e50257706a771fcebaecb893c22dd40978"}],"sha":"bcab8500fabe8f22e76fb9776328296604ca53b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/commits/bcab8500fabe8f22e76fb9776328296604ca53b2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44068562?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Leikoe","id":44068562,"login":"Leikoe","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MDY4NTYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/commits/08ef12e50257706a771fcebaecb893c22dd40978/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T04:02:42Z","email":"leo.paille@enseirb-matmeca.fr","name":"Léo Paillé"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T04:02:42Z","email":"leo.paille@enseirb-matmeca.fr","name":"Léo Paillé"},"message":"runtime: replay captured graphs as the Program decode path\n\nMetalGraph existed but nothing public called it: every try_run\nre-allocated intermediates, rebuilt 408 dispatches, and re-encoded an\nencoder per kernel. Program::capture now freezes one binding set into a\nMetalReplay — the attic decode loops'' proven parity design, centralized:\ndeclared feedback pairs (a cache output becomes the NEXT step''s input)\nping-pong between two eagerly captured graphs, everything else (weights,\nintermediates, CPU-written token ids) is one buffer in both. step() is\none executeCommandsInBuffer; SANIC_DEBUG=2 steps fall back to the\nper-dispatch timed dump, so the launch profiler survives replay.\n\nRead tinygrad''s metal graph and MLX before finishing. Kept our residency\nset covering pipelines (the first-class M1/M2 fix tinygrad still hacks\naround with dummy dispatches) and our hazard-aware barriers (MLX''s\nmaybeInsertBarrier converges on the same rule; tinygrad barriers every\ncommand). Took tinygrad''s u32 lesson: ICBs encode binding offsets as\nu32 on the wire, so capture refuses them — a >4 GB zero-copy checkpoint\nslice must stay on direct dispatch. Also fixed capture''s bindless\nhandling: argbuf dispatches bind the address table at 0 and the output\nat 1 (per-parity tables — their contents differ), inputs ride the\nresidency set.\n\nReplays are error-checked and fail fast as Results: a command buffer\nerror — our own fault or an \"innocent victim\" discard from a system-wide\nGPU recovery (observed live; the old unchecked path would have continued\nsilently on stale writes) — surfaces as RunError::Backend through\nMetalReplay::step, and the decode loop stops.\n\nLlama 3.2 1B decode 20.5 -> 25.8 tok/s wall at 38 ms/tok GPU residency\n(the example now prints it; <1 ms CPU per step), prefill 0.65 -> 0.25 s,\ngreedy tokens unchanged. Three GPU tests: feedback ping-pong vs oracle,\nsingle-graph rerun over live bindings, feedback validation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"adfd13b1250eca0d38a8fc812a49f0d0f6d5463b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/git/trees/adfd13b1250eca0d38a8fc812a49f0d0f6d5463b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/git/commits/08ef12e50257706a771fcebaecb893c22dd40978","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44068562?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Leikoe","id":44068562,"login":"Leikoe","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MDY4NTYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Leikoe/sanic/commit/08ef12e50257706a771fcebaecb893c22dd40978","node_id":"C_kwDOTBf03doAKDA4ZWYxMmU1MDI1NzcwNmE3NzFmY2ViYWVjYjg5M2MyMmRkNDA5Nzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Leikoe/sanic/commit/9067f09c0e3db4668945108248fa26304067c720","sha":"9067f09c0e3db4668945108248fa26304067c720","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/commits/9067f09c0e3db4668945108248fa26304067c720"}],"sha":"08ef12e50257706a771fcebaecb893c22dd40978","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/commits/08ef12e50257706a771fcebaecb893c22dd40978"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44068562?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Leikoe","id":44068562,"login":"Leikoe","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MDY4NTYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/commits/9067f09c0e3db4668945108248fa26304067c720/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T03:15:41Z","email":"leo.paille@enseirb-matmeca.fr","name":"Léo Paillé"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T03:15:41Z","email":"leo.paille@enseirb-matmeca.fr","name":"Léo Paillé"},"message":"Merge feat/explicit-graph-frontend: positional tensor frontend, canonicalized IR, Llama 3.2 decode, crate loaders","tree":{"sha":"cfaf5d685c15e3307c36c26ff796c3b55533dcc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/git/trees/cfaf5d685c15e3307c36c26ff796c3b55533dcc0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/git/commits/9067f09c0e3db4668945108248fa26304067c720","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44068562?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Leikoe","id":44068562,"login":"Leikoe","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MDY4NTYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Leikoe/sanic/commit/9067f09c0e3db4668945108248fa26304067c720","node_id":"C_kwDOTBf03doAKDkwNjdmMDljMGUzZGI0NjY4OTQ1MTA4MjQ4ZmEyNjMwNDA2N2M3MjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Leikoe/sanic/commit/7e7fbb48b65c9b5ea7b0ef85e3cfe511d8a789cb","sha":"7e7fbb48b65c9b5ea7b0ef85e3cfe511d8a789cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/commits/7e7fbb48b65c9b5ea7b0ef85e3cfe511d8a789cb"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Leikoe/sanic/commit/aa200b24e355f56c13ceee6907bfc0d686f01339","sha":"aa200b24e355f56c13ceee6907bfc0d686f01339","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/commits/aa200b24e355f56c13ceee6907bfc0d686f01339"}],"sha":"9067f09c0e3db4668945108248fa26304067c720","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/commits/9067f09c0e3db4668945108248fa26304067c720"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44068562?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Leikoe","id":44068562,"login":"Leikoe","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MDY4NTYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/commits/aa200b24e355f56c13ceee6907bfc0d686f01339/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T03:14:12Z","email":"leo.paille@enseirb-matmeca.fr","name":"Léo Paillé"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T03:14:12Z","email":"leo.paille@enseirb-matmeca.fr","name":"Léo Paillé"},"message":"deps: replace the hand-rolled loaders with safetensors and tokenizers\n\nsrc/safetensors.rs (StFile, load, RawTensor, bf16_roundtrip, the tiny\nJSON parser) and src/bpe.rs (the GPT-2 byte-level encoder, with\ntests/bpe.rs) are deleted; both existed to keep weights and prompts\nflowing before the crates were in, and tokenizers had already replaced\nthe encoder at the prompt boundary. Both replacements are\ndev-dependencies — the library keeps zero non-platform dependencies.\n\nllama3_2 now opens the checkpoint ONCE: the crate''s read_metadata\nrefuses header-only buffers, so the old cheap-validate-then-bind split\nbecame read + SafeTensors::deserialize in place + validate (dtype\nenums, not strings) + bind. The page-aligned LEAKED allocation with the\nlead pad that 4-aligns the data section stays example-local — that is\nMetal-binding logic no format crate provides — and tensors bind at\npointer-difference offsets into the region. Verified end to end:\n2.47 GB binds zero-copy, greedy tokens unchanged, 20.5 decode tok/s.\n\n[package] trims to name/version/edition/rust-version/description/\nlicense/readme; exclude was redundant (references/ is gitignored and\nstays out of the package list).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cfaf5d685c15e3307c36c26ff796c3b55533dcc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/git/trees/cfaf5d685c15e3307c36c26ff796c3b55533dcc0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/git/commits/aa200b24e355f56c13ceee6907bfc0d686f01339","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44068562?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Leikoe","id":44068562,"login":"Leikoe","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MDY4NTYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Leikoe/sanic/commit/aa200b24e355f56c13ceee6907bfc0d686f01339","node_id":"C_kwDOTBf03doAKGFhMjAwYjI0ZTM1NWY1NmMxM2NlZWU2OTA3YmZjMGQ2ODZmMDEzMzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Leikoe/sanic/commit/fa71354f19638f1817d7b38c9b569d8ae8110bf0","sha":"fa71354f19638f1817d7b38c9b569d8ae8110bf0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/commits/fa71354f19638f1817d7b38c9b569d8ae8110bf0"}],"sha":"aa200b24e355f56c13ceee6907bfc0d686f01339","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/commits/aa200b24e355f56c13ceee6907bfc0d686f01339"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44068562?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Leikoe","id":44068562,"login":"Leikoe","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MDY4NTYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/commits/fa71354f19638f1817d7b38c9b569d8ae8110bf0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T02:52:24Z","email":"leo.paille@enseirb-matmeca.fr","name":"Léo Paillé"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T02:52:24Z","email":"leo.paille@enseirb-matmeca.fr","name":"Léo Paillé"},"message":"runtime: SANIC_DEBUG=2 times every kernel launch\n\nSANIC_DEBUG=1 stays the compile-time schedule dump; =2 now prints one\nline per launch at runtime, designed around what the reader asks rather\nthan tinygrad''s format: the stage''s OUTPUT name and kind (indices match\nthe =1 dump, so the two cross-reference), its GPU time with a bar scaled\nto the slowest launch and its exact share of the step (printed post-hoc\n— execute owns the whole step), measured-over-planned against the cost\nthe planner chose the schedule by (fused stages; the footer''s plan-sigma\nis the model''s aggregate calibration), and achieved fraction of the\ndevice''s memory bandwidth, suppressed when the logical-bytes upper bound\nis implausible (a gather reading one row of a huge table).\n\nMetal times are per-dispatch command-buffer GPU residency — accurate per\nkernel, but the submits add overhead, so the footer says it: the sum is\na debug number and run_timed measures the production step. When graph\nreplay (MetalGraph, currently uncalled) becomes the Program path,\nper-kernel times need counter sample buffers; only the measurement half\nchanges. The interpreter prints the same shape with wall times.\n\nFirst run already paid: the embedding-row folds launch with grid 1 at\nplan x20-x49 — the cost model misprices tiny-grid folds by an order of\nmagnitude — while the logits GEMM alone is ~14% of the step.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d27a913c8d88f7a0be1bc740a1d2e4adbfa9c5ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/git/trees/d27a913c8d88f7a0be1bc740a1d2e4adbfa9c5ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/git/commits/fa71354f19638f1817d7b38c9b569d8ae8110bf0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44068562?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Leikoe","id":44068562,"login":"Leikoe","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MDY4NTYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Leikoe/sanic/commit/fa71354f19638f1817d7b38c9b569d8ae8110bf0","node_id":"C_kwDOTBf03doAKGZhNzEzNTRmMTk2MzhmMTgxN2Q3YjM4YzliNTY5ZDhhZTgxMTBiZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Leikoe/sanic/commit/2ce157296befb12c4dd8af06c41e0cd589c6bfee","sha":"2ce157296befb12c4dd8af06c41e0cd589c6bfee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/commits/2ce157296befb12c4dd8af06c41e0cd589c6bfee"}],"sha":"fa71354f19638f1817d7b38c9b569d8ae8110bf0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/commits/fa71354f19638f1817d7b38c9b569d8ae8110bf0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44068562?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Leikoe","id":44068562,"login":"Leikoe","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MDY4NTYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/commits/2ce157296befb12c4dd8af06c41e0cd589c6bfee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T02:52:24Z","email":"leo.paille@enseirb-matmeca.fr","name":"Léo Paillé"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T02:52:24Z","email":"leo.paille@enseirb-matmeca.fr","name":"Léo Paillé"},"message":"ir: canonicalize the frontend before lowering and partition''s rebuilds\n\nThe llama3_2 schedule dump showed each layer''s embedding+RMSNorm chain\nmaterialized once per q/k/v consumer and the RoPE tables 32 times. Two\nseparate holes, on either side of the entry canonicalize:\n\nPartition manufactured duplicates AFTER it: replace_many rebuilds whole\nsubtrees fresh, and the unplannable-fold retry then cuts nodes out of the\nrebuild — a new pointer per consumer, invisible to the pointer-keyed\n`done`. The partitioner now keeps the Canonicalizer its roots went\nthrough (kernel_ir''s entry pass, refactored into tree/shallow) and routes\nevery node it constructs — splice_memo, replace_many — back through it,\nso a rebuilt structural twin IS the original node and cuts deduplicate.\n\nLowering split frontend twins BEFORE it: fresh scoped axes are minted per\nnode, so two copies of the same public subtree (a RoPE frequency table\nbuilt per rope_at call) become axis-distinct and permanently unmergeable.\nir::canonicalize_many now runs before lowering, where the copies are\nstill structurally equal.\n\nLlama 3.2 1B decode: 643 -> 408 kernels, compile 30.9 -> 24.1s, decode\n14.3 -> 20.0 tok/s, logits and greedy tokens unchanged. The RoPE\nfrequency/cos/sin tables each collapse to ONE stage for the whole model.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"160e0eaf3497cb812c4894adaaf78459a5f72768","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/git/trees/160e0eaf3497cb812c4894adaaf78459a5f72768"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/git/commits/2ce157296befb12c4dd8af06c41e0cd589c6bfee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44068562?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Leikoe","id":44068562,"login":"Leikoe","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MDY4NTYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Leikoe/sanic/commit/2ce157296befb12c4dd8af06c41e0cd589c6bfee","node_id":"C_kwDOTBf03doAKDJjZTE1NzI5NmJlZmIxMmM0ZGQ4YWYwNmM0MWUwY2Q1ODljNmJmZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Leikoe/sanic/commit/211e8e9809a32fcc080c60d572b35c341aa550fb","sha":"211e8e9809a32fcc080c60d572b35c341aa550fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/commits/211e8e9809a32fcc080c60d572b35c341aa550fb"}],"sha":"2ce157296befb12c4dd8af06c41e0cd589c6bfee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/commits/2ce157296befb12c4dd8af06c41e0cd589c6bfee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44068562?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Leikoe","id":44068562,"login":"Leikoe","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MDY4NTYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/commits/211e8e9809a32fcc080c60d572b35c341aa550fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-19T17:45:16Z","email":"leo.paille@enseirb-matmeca.fr","name":"Léo Paillé"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-19T17:45:16Z","email":"leo.paille@enseirb-matmeca.fr","name":"Léo Paillé"},"message":"ir: canonicalize kernel graphs at partition entry\n\nTwo separately built but structurally identical subgraphs used to stay\ndistinct nodes: partition reads sharing through pointer-keyed maps\n(parents, done), so each copy was derived — and possibly computed — on\nits own. The fix is tinygrad''s hash-consing invariant (equal structure\nIS equal pointer), established the way tinygrad''s __reduce__ re-interns\non unpickle: rebuilt once at the boundary where it is consumed, not\nmaintained globally by an interning constructor.\n\nkernel_ir::canonicalize_many rebuilds roots bottom-up over one canonical\ntable; children are canonical before parents, so the key (shallow_key,\nextracted from simplify''s CSE, now shared) hashes children by pointer —\nO(children) per node, never O(subtree). Already-canonical subtrees keep\ntheir original Rc, so identities held elsewhere stay valid.\n\npartition_many canonicalizes before counting parents, covering compile\nand every direct caller. Not in verify: interp and grad legitimately\nverify hand-built non-canonical graphs, so canonicity is an invariant of\npartition''s input, not of the IR.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f0b922e5fb60a387ac1fc51d3afa3289a8c3168d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/git/trees/f0b922e5fb60a387ac1fc51d3afa3289a8c3168d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Leikoe/sanic/git/commits/211e8e9809a32fcc080c60d572b35c341aa550fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44068562?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Leikoe","id":44068562,"login":"Leikoe","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MDY4NTYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leikoe","user_vi