2b0c74eea7484acf2a8ec26f5060/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T14:47:34Z","email":"oliver.benham@infinityworks.com","name":"Oli Benham"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T14:47:34Z","email":"oliver.benham@infinityworks.com","name":"Oli Benham"},"message":"Improve review UX and the Qdrant-down error message\n\n- Qdrant unreachable now reports an actionable message (which URL failed and\n  how to start the vector DB) across index status, the indexing SSE stream\n  and query 503s, instead of leaking \"[Errno 61] Connection refused\";\n  rag.qdrant_unreachable() classifies connection failures anywhere in the\n  exception chain while real bugs keep their own error text.\n- \"Generate final deck\" opens an options dropdown (Include references lives\n  there now, extensible for future options); its Generate button creates the\n  deck and starts the download directly — no second download button.\n- The Unreviewed prev/next buttons scroll the slides pane so the selected\n  finding is centred in view.\n- UI regression checklist updated to match (dropdown finalize + direct\n  download, new scroll-on-navigate check).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"045689ee5acd5b74d19f0de45fbe5d07d55951d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenhamOT/dd-assistant/git/trees/045689ee5acd5b74d19f0de45fbe5d07d55951d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenhamOT/dd-assistant/git/commits/b85612b55f292b0c74eea7484acf2a8ec26f5060","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/BenhamOT/dd-assistant/commit/b85612b55f292b0c74eea7484acf2a8ec26f5060","node_id":"C_kwDOTBnkldoAKGI4NTYxMmI1NWYyOTJiMGM3NGVlYTc0ODRhY2YyYThlYzI2ZjUwNjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenhamOT/dd-assistant/commit/5dfe390d348a202f6f53130314df7c51dd18f2ca","sha":"5dfe390d348a202f6f53130314df7c51dd18f2ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenhamOT/dd-assistant/commits/5dfe390d348a202f6f53130314df7c51dd18f2ca"}],"sha":"b85612b55f292b0c74eea7484acf2a8ec26f5060","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenhamOT/dd-assistant/commits/b85612b55f292b0c74eea7484acf2a8ec26f5060"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenhamOT/dd-assistant/commits/5dfe390d348a202f6f53130314df7c51dd18f2ca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T10:59:59Z","email":"oliver.benham@infinityworks.com","name":"Oli Benham"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T10:59:59Z","email":"oliver.benham@infinityworks.com","name":"Oli Benham"},"message":"Add embedding warm-up, query clear-conversation and richer source previews\n\n- Warm the local embedding model on a background thread at server startup\n  (DD_EMBED_WARMUP, default on; offline UI-test server opts out) so the\n  first Document Query index doesn''t pay the model-load latency.\n- Add DELETE /api/jobs/{id}/query/history and a confirm-guarded \"clear\n  conversation\" in both query UIs (shared styled confirm dialog in app.js).\n- Source previews: honour a ?context= window, highlight full cited ranges\n  (B3:D3), label locator precision, and serve the original upload via\n  GET /api/jobs/{id}/source-file.\n- Drop the unused per-finding citation-visibility toggle; finalize keeps\n  every citation unless the global no-references option is chosen.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"02388c43e9f513a4f160bd2889ecb111dd35aa66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenhamOT/dd-assistant/git/trees/02388c43e9f513a4f160bd2889ecb111dd35aa66"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenhamOT/dd-assistant/git/commits/5dfe390d348a202f6f53130314df7c51dd18f2ca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/BenhamOT/dd-assistant/commit/5dfe390d348a202f6f53130314df7c51dd18f2ca","node_id":"C_kwDOTBnkldoAKDVkZmUzOTBkMzQ4YTIwMmY2Z