,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T14:08:13Z","email":"oliver.benham@infinityworks.com","name":"Oli Benham"},"message":"Add Document Query (RAG) feature and refine agents\n\n- RAG flow: local embeddings + per-job Qdrant, index/query endpoints and page\n- Fold chunking helpers into RagEngine; default its store/embedder/parser in\n  __init__ (removing the default_engine factory)\n- Guard model (Haiku): use standard thinking and drop the unsupported effort param\n- Update CLAUDE.md conventions, README, tests and deps\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"784fe222841d4ad666470a1cd677f708807f50a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenhamOT/dd-assistant/git/trees/784fe222841d4ad666470a1cd677f708807f50a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenhamOT/dd-assistant/git/commits/10f87aca5c13136c6554b82a42c5af1ce6e7e0ed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/BenhamOT/dd-assistant/commit/10f87aca5c13136c6554b82a42c5af1ce6e7e0ed","node_id":"C_kwDOTBnkldoAKDEwZjg3YWNhNWMxMzEzNmM2NTU0YjgyYTQyYzVhZjFjZTZlN2UwZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BenhamOT/dd-assistant/commit/41603240159e8414aa49461bf10e273d0f14a8d7","sha":"41603240159e8414aa49461bf10e273d0f14a8d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenhamOT/dd-assistant/commits/41603240159e8414aa49461bf10e273d0f14a8d7"}],"sha":"10f87aca5c13136c6554b82a42c5af1ce6e7e0ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenhamOT/dd-assistant/commits/10f87aca5c13136c6554b82a42c5af1ce6e7e0ed"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BenhamOT/dd-assistant/commits/41603240159e8414aa49461bf10e273d0f14a8d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:52:10Z","email":"oliver.benham@infinityworks.com","name":"Oli Benham"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:52:10Z","email":"oliver.benham@infinityworks.com","name":"Oli Benham"},"message":"Updating code s