:{"date":"2026-07-27T00:39:33Z","email":"code.shivam.si@gmail.com","name":"codeshivamsi-sketch"},"message":"fix(agentic): drop dead agent import, guard empty stream result\n\napi/main.py imported agents.agents.agent but never referenced it directly\n(both /agent and /evaluate enqueue jobs by string name) — new ruff F401\nfinding, and the import eagerly builds the LangGraph graph and opens a\nSQLite checkpoint connection the API process no longer needs.\n\ncore/jobs.py: guard against agent.stream() yielding zero states, which\nwould otherwise raise AttributeError on result.get(...) instead of\nproducing a clean score/feedback-less payload for core-api to reject.","tree":{"sha":"f033c0287d1a40a607a8fdceeba16b30d24e1144","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/git/trees/f033c0287d1a40a607a8fdceeba16b30d24e1144"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/git/commits/d6d64b0e5769c172feab1e1a0b4693752ac60a26","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276733462?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/codeshivamsi-sketch","id":276733462,"login":"codeshivamsi-sketch","node_id":"U_kgDOEH6eFg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","sub