"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/commits/16f9a443ff52c0f84b470935c6fb04d898228232/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T03:28:25Z","email":"code.shivam.si@gmail.com","name":"codeshivamsi-sketch"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T03:28:25Z","email":"code.shivam.si@gmail.com","name":"codeshivamsi-sketch"},"message":"feat(core-api): add POST /internal/chat-answers callback\n\nAdds the internal callback endpoint that services/agentic''s RQ worker\n(run_agent_job) POSTs its LangGraph result to, replacing the synchronous\nask_question round-trip with agentic_client.request_answer''s\nfire-and-forget dispatch. The callback extracts the answer (or serializes\nnon-answer results), inserts the assistant Message, optionally creates a\nQuiz row for quiz-intent results, and dispatches notify_quiz_ready with\nchat_id/message_id. No auth dependency: it''s internal-only and derives\nuser_id from the Chat row.\n\nrequest_quiz is deliberately left in agentic_client.py for now (not\ndeleted per the plan''s literal text) because worker.py''s generate_quiz\ntask still calls it and won''t be retired until Task 5 — removing it now\nwould break the whole suite''s import chain, not just the message tests\nthis task''s brief anticipated.\n\ncreate_message in routes.py still calls the now-removed ask_question;\nTask 4 rewrites it. Expected fallout: test_chats_route.py''s message\ntests (mock routes.ask_question) fail, plus the 2 pre-existing\ncelery-retry-worker tests that need a dedicated worker process.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"175c40899f6b3442263de17c440659afb035c896","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/git/trees/175c40899f6b3442263de17c440659afb035c896"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/git/commits/16f9a443ff52c0f84b470935c6fb04d898228232","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276733462?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/codeshivamsi-sketch","id":276733462,"login":"codeshivamsi-sketch","node_id":"U_kgDOEH6eFg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/commit/16f9a443ff52c0f84b470935c6fb04d898228232","node_id":"C_kwDOTByTqtoAKDE2ZjlhNDQzZmY1MmMwZjg0YjQ3MDkzNWM2ZmIwNGQ4OTgyMjgyMzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/commit/b4ca2197e4f89a429bcd628ae43425554ac36717","sha":"b4ca2197e4f89a429bcd628ae43425554ac36717","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/commits/b4ca2197e4f89a429bcd628ae43425554ac36717"}],"sha":"16f9a443ff52c0f84b470935c6fb04d898228232","ur