,"events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/codeshivamsi-sketch","id":276733462,"login":"codeshivamsi-sketch","node_id":"U_kgDOEH6eFg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/commits/8ffae2be02a355856e057de12b349ec3b9d851cc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T22:21:44Z","email":"code.shivam.si@gmail.com","name":"codeshivamsi-sketch"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T22:21:44Z","email":"code.shivam.si@gmail.com","name":"codeshivamsi-sketch"},"message":"fix(agentic): sanitize upload filename to stop path traversal\n\nfile.filename is client-controlled; a filename like ../../etc/pwned.pdf\nlet save_pdf_on_disk write outside uploads/. Now reachable through the\nauthenticated core-api upload endpoint, not just direct-to-agentic\ntesting. Sanitize with os.path.basename() and have save_pdf_on_disk\nreturn the sanitized name so the caller reads back the file it\nactually wrote, instead of re-deriving the unsanitized path a second\ntime (which would 500 on any traversal attempt post-fix).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":