{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276733462?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/codeshivamsi-sketch","id":276733462,"login":"codeshivamsi-sketch","node_id":"U_kgDOEH6eFg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/commits/700ef6b5d36a1aa5c78bdf1b3f3fb53a2babec61/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T19:53:45Z","email":"code.shivam.si@gmail.com","name":"codeshivamsi-sketch"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T19:53:45Z","email":"code.shivam.si@gmail.com","name":"codeshivamsi-sketch"},"message":"docs: add design spec for Phase B4 (core-api <-> agentic quiz generation)\n\nCorrects the original plan''s assumption that the agentic service could\ngenerate a quiz \"for a document\" as-is -- it has no document concept at\nall (single global Chroma collection, no document_id anywhere). Adds\ndocument-scoping to the agentic service and a real upload endpoint to\ncore-api as prerequisites, confirmed with the user, before the async\nquiz-generation task itself.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","t