_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/commits/fbc27875397900400114ee31a5cbd53203442106/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T09:51:18Z","email":"code.shivam.si@gmail.com","name":"codeshivamsi-sketch"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T09:51:18Z","email":"code.shivam.si@gmail.com","name":"codeshivamsi-sketch"},"message":"fix(agentic): wire real credentials via env_file, guard secrets from image builds\n\ndocker-compose''s ${VAR} substitution only reads a root .env, which\ndoesn''t exist here — switch the agentic service to env_file pointing\nat services/agentic/.env so the real ANTHROPIC_API_KEY/LANGCHAIN_*\nvalues it already contains actually reach the container. Add a\nscoped .dockerignore (the service''s build context is\n./services/agentic, not the repo root, so the root .dockerignore''s\n**/.env rule never covered it) to stop a future rebuild from baking\nthe real key into an image layer.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8e9c7fa12ba5ab9e9187498aa53da1d5b3ddd62d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/git/trees/8e9c7fa12ba5ab9e9187498aa53da1d5b3ddd62d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/git/commits/fbc27875397900400114ee31a5cbd53203442106","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276733462?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/fol