_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/codeshivamsi-sketch","id":276733462,"login":"codeshivamsi-sketch","node_id":"U_kgDOEH6eFg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/commits/a99640c3234c1882e961f6fa71ed1440c9f7d35f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T01:26:36Z","email":"code.shivam.si@gmail.com","name":"codeshivamsi-sketch"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T01:26:36Z","email":"code.shivam.si@gmail.com","name":"codeshivamsi-sketch"},"message":"fix(agentic): bundle eval deps, mount checkpoints via a symlinked directory\n\nNamed-volume mounts onto a single file are unreliable across Docker\nEngine versions - some silently turn the target into a directory,\nothers (containerd-snapshotter backends) fail container creation\noutright with ''is not directory''. /data is a real directory (the\nuniversally-supported mount case); checkpoints.db is a symlink into\nit, so sqlite3.connect() in agents.py needs no code changes and still\ntransparently persists through the mounted volume.","tree":{"sha":"571f06f552b91b4620a5e3654fbf7442f9c4d6df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/git/trees/571f06f552b91b4620a5e3654fbf7442f9c4d6df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/git/commits/a99640c3234c1882e961f6fa71ed1440c9f7d35f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276733462?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/codeshivamsi-sketch","id":276733462,"login":"codeshivamsi-sketch","node_id":"U_kgDOEH6eFg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/commit/a99640c3234c1882e961f6fa71ed1440c9f7d35f","node_id":"C_kwDOTByTqtoAKGE5OTY0MGMzMjM0YzE4ODJlOTYxZjZmYTcxZWQxNDQwYzlmN2QzNWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/commit/b4aa48997a75b3137aa11547a0bb275a22d2667a","sha":"b4aa48997a75b3137aa11547a0bb275a22d2667a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/commits/b4aa48997a75b3137aa11547a0bb275a22d2667a"}],"sha":"a99640c3234c1882e961f6fa71ed1440c9f7d35f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/commits/a99640c3234c1882e961f6fa71ed1440c9f7d35f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276733462?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/codeshivamsi-sketch","id":276733462,"login":"codeshivamsi-sketch","node_id":"U_kgDOEH6eFg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/commits/b4aa48997a75b3137aa11547a0bb275a22d2667a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T01:25:44Z","email":"code.shivam.si@gmail.com","name":"codeshivamsi-sketch"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T01:25:44Z","email":"code.shivam.si@gmail.com","name":"codeshivamsi-sketch"},"message":"Fix Task 2/3/4: replace single-file volume mount with symlinked directory\n\nTask 4''s implementer hit a real container-creation failure: this\nmachine''s Docker Engine (containerd-snapshotter backend) refuses to\ncreate a named volume whose mount target is a single file\n(agentic_checkpoints:/app/checkpoints.db), even though the file\nexisted correctly in the image (Task 2''s RUN touch fix was verified\ncorrect at the image layer - the failure is one level up, at volume\ncreation). Named-volume-onto-directory is the universally supported\ncase across Docker Engine versions, so the fix makes /data a real\ndirectory that the volume mounts onto, with checkpoints.db as a\nsymlink into it - no application code changes needed, since\nsqlite3.connect() follows the symlink transparently.\n\nImplementer also correctly refused to route around a permission\ndenial on docker volume ls/rm while investigating - noted for the\nrecord, no action needed on that front since the new approach doesn''t\nrequire touching existing volumes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a2f5e250fdc50eeec9ae3a074f8fcfbfced21eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/git/trees/9a2f5e250fdc50eeec9ae3a074f8fcfbfced21eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/git/commits/b4aa48997a75b3137aa11547a0bb275a22d2667a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276733462?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/codeshivamsi-sketch","id":276733462,"login":"codeshivamsi-sketch","node_id":"U_kgDOEH6eFg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://gi