vents","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/commits/9ecca3427e2f8cfa710624250491df55319970bf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T00:24:43Z","email":"code.shivam.si@gmail.com","name":"codeshivamsi-sketch"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T00:24:43Z","email":"code.shivam.si@gmail.com","name":"codeshivamsi-sketch"},"message":"Add design spec for consolidating the agentic service into the monorepo\n\nCorrects several load-bearing errors in the original request: the\nservice uses ANTHROPIC_API_KEY exclusively (not OPENAI_API_KEY), hard-\ndepends on Neo4j (entirely missing from the original plan), listens on\nport 8000 internally (collides with core-api''s existing host port\n8000), and needs neither postgres nor redis. Flattens the upstream\nrepo''s backend/ subdirectory up to match this repo''s services/<name>/\nconvention. Resolved two deferred details during spec self-review\nrather than leaving them as TBD: the LangGraph SQLite checkpoint file\nis a single file (not a directory) requiring a Dockerfile RUN touch so\nDocker''s named-volume mount doesn''t silently turn it into a directory,\nand the uploads/ gitignore pattern needs the existing PDF fixture\nforce-added once so it stays tracked despite matching the pattern.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7d0c5766624cfbdac2eb67c7b3a0a4c6d98f4d1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/git/trees/7d0c5766624cfbdac2eb67c7b3a0a4c6d98f4d1e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_