ppened - a hypothetical worker that only retried\ntwice (~2.0-2.2s) could still clear that threshold and false-pass.\nTightened to >= 2.5, close enough to the expected ~3s to catch a\nmissing retry while leaving slack for gRPC connect-attempt timing.\nRe-ran against a real worker: 3.18s elapsed, 3 retry log lines then\nFAILURE, as expected.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8dff1cceccf0512d4a85a13f9cb936d350dc8896","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/git/trees/8dff1cceccf0512d4a85a13f9cb936d350dc8896"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/git/commits/9d978e9501c05ec3fc3e8cd65b0f7bc13229c708","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276733462?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/codeshivamsi-sketch","id":276733462,"login":"codeshivamsi-sketch","node_id":"U_kgDOEH6eFg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/commit/9d97