"2026-07-19T22:52:04Z","email":"code.shivam.si@gmail.com","name":"codeshivamsi-sketch"},"message":"fix(core-api): route retry test to a dedicated Celery queue\n\nTask review found the test''s dedicated worker shared Redis with the\nalways-running docker-compose worker container (default queue,\nreachable notifications) - a race where the compose worker could\nsteal and succeed the task before the fake-unreachable-target retry\ncycle ever ran. Route dispatch and consumption to a dedicated queue\n(notify_quiz_ready_retry_test) instead of stopping/restarting the\ncompose container around the test.","tree":{"sha":"ef73c045127f3fdab91212d9b91ad8ff670c7b5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/git/trees/ef73c045127f3fdab91212d9b91ad8ff670c7b5e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/git/commits/2dcc0f1d015847791ccc9804f1008fd970ba67c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276733462?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/codeshivamsi-sketch","id":276733462,"login":"codeshivamsi-sketch","node_id":"U_kgDOEH6eFg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/commit/2dcc0f1d015847791ccc9804f1008fd970ba67c3","node_id":"C_kwDOTByTqtoAKDJkY2MwZjFkMDE1ODQ3NzkxY2NjOTgwNGYxMDA4ZmQ5NzBiYTY3YzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/commit/985252c87c922a75b33b3372b4bfcdcb0eb5b841","sha":"985252c87c922a75b33b3372b4bfcdcb0eb5b841","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/commits/985252c87c922a75b33b3372b4bfcdcb0eb5b841"}],"sha":"2dcc0f1d015847791ccc9804f1008fd970ba67c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/commits/2dcc0f1d015847791ccc9804f1008fd970ba67c3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276733462?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/codeshivamsi-sketch","id":276733462,"login":"codeshivamsi-sketch","node_id":"U_kgDOEH6eFg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/commits/985252c87c922a75b33b3372b4bfcdcb0eb5b841/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-19T22:51:12Z","email":"code.shivam.si@gmail.com","name":"codeshivamsi-sketch"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-19T22:51:12Z","email":"code.shivam.si@gmail.com","name":"codeshivamsi-sketch"},"message":"Fix Task 4''s retry test: route to a dedicated queue\n\nImplementer correctly caught that the test''s dedicated worker shares\nRedis with the always-running docker-compose worker container, which\nlistens on the default queue and points at a reachable notifications\nservice - a race where the compose worker could steal and succeed the\ntask before the fake-unreachable-target retry cycle ever runs. Worked\naround it by manually stopping/restarting the container, which isn''t\ndurable (breaks CI, easy to forget on a re-run).\n\nPermanent fix: route this test''s dispatch to a dedicated queue\n(queue=\"notify_quiz_ready_retry_test\") and have the test''s worker\nconsume only from it (-Q notify_quiz_ready_retry_test), so the two\nworkers never contend regardless of what else is running.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"33f8a131364cef817abd010fc56a807fbd3899fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/git/trees/33f8a131364cef817abd010fc56a807fbd3899fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/git/commits/985252c87c922a75b33b3372b4bfcdcb0eb5b841","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276733462?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/gists{/gist_id}","gr