6e5d7c858e9521da68ac9a491f9c63ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-19T22:31:12Z","email":"code.shivam.si@gmail.com","name":"codeshivamsi-sketch"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-19T22:31:12Z","email":"code.shivam.si@gmail.com","name":"codeshivamsi-sketch"},"message":"Add design spec for Phase B3 async quiz notification via Celery\n\nMoves the notifications gRPC call from the POST /quizzes request path\n(asyncio.to_thread, Phase B2) into a real Celery task with retry, so\na slow/flaky notifications service can no longer add latency to quiz\ncreation at all. Corrects two premises in the original request: the\nendpoint already returns 200 (not 201) and stays 200 (not 202, since\nthe quiz itself is still created synchronously); retry testing uses a\nreal short-countdown integration test rather than eager mode or a\nliteral 60s wait, via a new NOTIFY_QUIZ_READY_RETRY_COUNTDOWN env var.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a1b4edd439da01e62c5870f2db7ded1716ca9a3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/git/trees/a1b4edd439da01e62c5870f2db7ded1716ca9a3f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/git/commits/4ff723a16e5d7c858e9521da68ac9a491f9c63ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276733462?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/codeshivamsi-sketch","id":276733462,"login":"codeshivamsi-sketch","node_id":"U_kgDOEH6eFg","organizations_url":"https://api.gi