ivamsi-sketch/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/commits/696f09003cd8a9e1c6395ba21497b5674e651e84/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-19T06:47:15Z","email":"code.shivam.si@gmail.com","name":"codeshivamsi-sketch"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-19T06:47:15Z","email":"code.shivam.si@gmail.com","name":"codeshivamsi-sketch"},"message":"Sync /arch: simplify from 6 diagram views to 2 static + on-demand traces\n\nUpstream ai_dev_workflow commit 8043c8d: default /arch output collapses\nto High-Level Architecture (component discovery from docker-compose +\ncodegraph) and ER Diagram (delete behavior folded into FK relationship\nlabels instead of a separate section). Per-endpoint call-tree/sequence\ndetail moves to on-demand prompting (/arch show flow [endpoint],\n/arch sequence [endpoint]), shown inline, never written to disk.\n\nSkipped syncing templates/commands/blast.md and docs-sync.md''s matching\nwording updates (renaming \"Data Access Map\" references to \"High-Level\nArchitecture diagram\") - not in the requested scope for this sync.\nThis repo''s own README.md has no /arch section to update (it documents\nthe EduMind project, not the ai_dev_workflow tool suite).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dfa286d48a377175a6183087aa168ce34545f86a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/git/trees/dfa286d48a377175a6183087aa168ce34545f86a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/