ub), Data Access Map adds its two\nendpoints plus the cross-service gRPC->BullMQ edge from POST /quizzes,\nDeployment adds the notifications compose service and the gRPC edge to\ncore-api, Request Flow switches to POST /quizzes as the new deepest\nwrite chain (crosses the service/process boundary via gRPC + BullMQ).\n\nFixed a real mindmap syntax bug caught by rendering each block through\nmermaid-cli: unquoted parentheses/colons in node text break the\nmindmap parser. Rewrote the affected lines without parens; verified\nall 6 blocks render cleanly afterward.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6e48497e6a92cc07b814c6ce33f339a92aacf788","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/git/trees/6e48497e6a92cc07b814c6ce33f339a92aacf788"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeshivamsi-sketch/ai_study_assistant_edumind/git/commits/f89f93b4b62f0e7c4925026d6b307f2ea12e0dba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276733462?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/codeshivamsi-sketch","id":276733462,"login":"codeshivamsi-sketch","node_id":"U_kgDOEH6eFg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeshivamsi-sketch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users