:"https://github.com/bas-h/django-spaserve/commit/99d856e213fed78dd627cc23becb9ecf19cd8a85","sha":"99d856e213fed78dd627cc23becb9ecf19cd8a85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bas-h/django-spaserve/commits/99d856e213fed78dd627cc23becb9ecf19cd8a85"}],"sha":"46e542170d005ed21da025d078c65b1f158d3cb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bas-h/django-spaserve/commits/46e542170d005ed21da025d078c65b1f158d3cb1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34470149?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bashtiger/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bashtiger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bashtiger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bashtiger/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bashtiger","id":34470149,"login":"bashtiger","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NDcwMTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bashtiger/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bashtiger/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bashtiger/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bashtiger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bashtiger/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bashtiger","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bas-h/django-spaserve/commits/99d856e213fed78dd627cc23becb9ecf19cd8a85/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T12:48:23Z","email":"bas@tigerlab.com","name":"Bassel J. Hamadeh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T12:48:23Z","email":"bas@tigerlab.com","name":"Bassel J. Hamadeh"},"message":"Initial commit: django-spaserve\n\nServe a built SPA (React/Vue/Svelte dist/) from Django with correct\nclient-side-routing fallback — a port of FastAPI''s app.frontend() feature.\n\n- Two mounting strategies: catch-all spa_urls() (A) and handler404 (B)\n- Faithful port of the nav-vs-asset Accept-header heuristic and 3-way decision\n- Traversal/symlink-safe file lookup; GET/HEAD only (405 otherwise)\n- Multi-SPA longest-prefix-wins, fallback modes (auto/index.html/404.html/None)\n- Conditional GET, no-cache shell, optional html_transform hook\n- Django system checks for directory/fallback validation\n- 61 tests; runnable Django + Vite/React example\n- CI matrix (Py 3.10–3.13 × Django 4.2–5.2) + PyPI Trusted-Publishing release,\n  all actions SHA-pinned\n\nDeveloped with the assistance of an AI coding agent.","tree":{"sha":"59d6d80a4edeeb30b957cb99dfa36cb118ad507a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bas-h/django-spaserve/git/trees/59d6d80a4edeeb30b957cb99dfa36cb118ad507a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bas-h/django-spaserve/git/commits/99d856e213fed78dd627cc23becb9ecf19cd8a85","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34470149?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bashtiger/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bashtiger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bashtiger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bashtiger/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bashtiger","id":34470149,"login":"bashtiger","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NDcwMTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bashtiger/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bashtiger/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bashtiger/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bashtiger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bashtiger/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bashtiger","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bas-h/django-spaserve/commit/99d856e213fed78dd627cc23becb9ecf19cd8a85","node_id":"